WEBVTT

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:28.440
Wow!

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:29.520
Look!

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.400
The endless horizon, wherever you look!

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.150
So wide.

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:34.610
Finally, I've arrived!

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:36.110
We are on the mainland!

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:41.380
They're saying that the leader of the mounted bandits that's prowling Manchuria is Japanese!

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:42.870
Black Wolf or something.

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:47.290
It seems he's a possible survivor of a troop despatched to Siberia.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:49.750
Lieutenant, wait for me!

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:54.300
I will definitely find you.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.550
When I do, we will never be apart!

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:01.100
And everything will finally turn into a happy ending!

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.720
And then...

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:06.140
Boss?

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:07.600
You'll see!

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:10.520
I have a special scent on such things!

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:13.150
As planned, everything will turn out well.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:22.200
Part 2

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:22.200
Haikara-san ga Tooru

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:22.200
Hana no Tokyo Dai Roman

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:28.580
That's Black Wolf!

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:29.960
Trouble! Black Wolf!

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:31.130
Black Wolf?

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:38.170
Could it be, it's ...

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:40.180
People say they're no joke.

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:41.930
What are you saying?

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:44.180
We just arrived, and immediately the mounted bandits came charging.

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:46.680
Just as anticipated.

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:06.200
Ladies and Gentlemen!

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:08.700
If you are willing to give us your valuables,

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:10.710
your live will be spared.

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:11.920
Don't move!

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:13.130
Don't dare move!

00:02:13.130 --> 00:02:14.840
Give us all valuables!

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:21.430
Where is the Black Wolf?

00:02:21.430 --> 00:02:22.220
Damn you!

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:23.640
How dare you!

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:27.720
Bastard! How dare you raise a hand to my Boss?!

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:29.920
Hey, what have you got there?

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:35.310
Chief!

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:36.820
We're in trouble!

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:39.940
Japanese samurai woman is fighting?!

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:46.580
Chief, that woman is ...

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:52.000
Are you the Black Wolf?

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.540
If that is you, I need to ask you something.

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.130
You ?!

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:03.130
As I thought!

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:04.260
Chief!

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:05.390
Border Patrol!

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:05.890
Hell!

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:06.900
Retreat!

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:08.930
What if it's the lieutenant?

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:09.740
Boss!

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:10.720
Wait!

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:12.730
I am a journalist from Japan!

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:13.730
Please!

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:17.310
I definitely need to interview you!

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:20.110
Wait, Black Wolf-san!

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:23.820
Good bye, Boss!

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:25.570
Wait!

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:27.410
I need an interview! Definitely!

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:28.660
Interview, you said?

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:30.950
Black Wolf-san!

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:33.370
A few words for your fans!

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:48.300
Lieutenant?

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:49.350
Lieutenant!

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:50.760
It's not Lieutenant!

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:51.430
It can't be!

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:52.550
Who are you?!

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:54.310
No! No! Let go!

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:55.270
What?!

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:57.440
You're the one who followed us!

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:07.570
I thought so.You're that Benio Hanamura-san.

00:04:07.570 --> 00:04:10.740
Commander Ijuin's fiancee.

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:12.330
How do you know me?

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:18.330
I was a fighter of the 12th Kokura Infantry Division of the Imperial Army.

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:20.340
Sergeant Onijima at your service.

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:23.260
Onijima from Kokura?

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:26.340
Commander Ijuin you're looking for..

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:28.760
was my Commander.

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:33.310
The Commander has always treasure your photo.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:38.690
What nonsense.

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:42.360
The Commander said she’s prettier in life than in the photo, but that was a lie.

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.980
What is?

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:45.740
No.

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:47.240
Benio-san.

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:49.700
Calm down and listen to me.

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:53.290
That day, the Commander

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:54.700
In Siberian winter

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:56.790
Onijima! Where are you?

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:57.540
Stop!

00:04:57.540 --> 00:04:58.870
Don't come here!

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:00.960
Leave me!

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:02.380
Onijima!

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:03.530
I'll be right there!

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:10.390
Commander!

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:15.790
The army left us to the mercy of fate.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:17.520
And then..

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:22.650
I defected, and then moved into the Hunhuza
and began to attack the Japanese garrisons.

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:27.320
Because of the army, such a man died!
I will never forgive them!

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:29.530
I'm sorry, Benio-san!

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:32.410
Commander Ijuin died because of me.

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:36.410
No, Onijima-san.

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:39.960
The fact that the Lieutenant was sent to Siberia

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:41.250
was my fault.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.630
Because of me, the Lieutenant..

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:49.510
Later, I heard from my father.

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:53.350
Because I pissed off the Commander of the lieutenant,

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:55.640
he was transferred to the Kokura division.

00:05:56.430 --> 00:05:58.770
No matter how I regret it,

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:01.980
Lieutenant

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:04.170
will not return.

00:06:04.730 --> 00:06:07.440
So that’s why she came this far.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:09.700
Is that vodka?

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:10.450
Uhm.

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:11.740
Yes.

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:13.870
Lieutenant said

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:17.830
In Russia, there's a kind of liquor called vodka.

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:20.790
He promised to bring some as souvenir.

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:25.750
Lieutenant!!!

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:27.500
That's mine!

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:29.550
Stupid! That's vodka!

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:31.720
It's too strong for you. It'll kill you.

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:32.930
Leave me alone!

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:36.470
Lieutenant is not here anymore.
If I die too, it’s for the better.

00:06:38.470 --> 00:06:40.480
I'm such a fool!

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:45.300
I specially came to Manchuria to find out about him.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:48.300
No! I don't believe the Lieutenant is dead!

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:51.240
Lieutenant!

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:00.790
А-а-а! My head hurts!

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:03.210
Jeez. What kind of woman are you?

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:05.250
Here. Water.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.920
Thank you.

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:13.180
I didn't die.

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.390
Let's go get some air.

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:30.530
This plain stretches is Siberia , right?

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:35.570
Is this the flower, malinka?

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:38.910
Flower's name? I wouldn't know.

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:41.410
Malinka.

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:46.880
Just like you- small,
but very resilient.

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:57.510
Although they have to survive in the wasteland,
they are persistently reaching up.

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:02.220
That's why, that kind of courage makes them so beautiful.

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:10.110
Аh...

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:12.110
Lieutenant!

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:14.970
I understood.

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.620
Onijima-san.

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:22.110
Can I ask you one thing?

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:23.410
What is it?

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:28.580
You haven’t seen the Lieutenant’s body with your own eyes, right?

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:29.670
No.

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:34.000
I believe Lieutenant is still alive.

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.590
I believe that no matter what.

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:39.550
Well..

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:41.760
That's right.

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:45.180
That's why I don’t want to die anymore.

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:49.100
From now on, I will live while looking forward.

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:00.990
If you go along this path, you will arrive at the station.

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:02.990
You can see it from here, right?

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:06.620
Yes. Thank you for everything, Onijima-san.

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:10.920
If the Commander is still alive, you should definitely return to Japan.

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:13.460
I will investigate over here.

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:16.920
Then, if you come to Japan, visit us.

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:25.390
A woman alone reached as far as Manchuria to find her fiancee ...

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:28.440
That's Hanamura Benio.

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:31.900
I see now, Commander.

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:34.110
How can you not fall in love with her.

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:38.650
I, too, am not going to forever be a Honghuzi.

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:46.200
Ushigoro.

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:48.370
Yahoo!

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:49.710
Boss!

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:51.880
How are you? How are you?

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:54.900
Well! It's time to return to Japan!

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:26.330
THE NINTH YEAR OF TAISO (1920), SEPTEMBER

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:26.550
Good morning!

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:29.160
GRAPHIC

00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:29.250
Hanamura Benio has returned.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.250
Welcome back.

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:32.250
How was Manchuria?

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:35.210
Chief. Hanamura-san has arrived.

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:37.250
Oh...

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:38.710
You've come back.

00:10:39.220 --> 00:10:40.070
So,

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:42.800
Did you learn anything about the your fiancee?

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:43.680
Yes.

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:44.950
But...

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:47.970
Chief!

00:10:47.970 --> 00:10:49.520
Okay, I get it.

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:52.170
Life is not like a fairytale.

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:54.210
Sorry.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:58.730
As soon as I saw you, somehow I started wailing.

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:00.530
I see.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:02.960
Um.

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:05.200
It turns out, you went in vain.

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:08.120
Yes, reality is cruel.

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:11.900
He's already history. You should forget about him.

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:14.330
No. I will not forget.

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:17.130
Lieutenant is..

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:19.950
the first person I fell in love with.

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:24.130
He always looked at me with such affection.

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:26.260
He's the only one.

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:27.750
I don't want to forget him.

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:33.730
In a way that won't disgrace him, I will live my live to the fullest.

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:34.770
Hanamura-san...

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:37.270
You are that serious?

00:11:37.270 --> 00:11:38.770
I see.

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:43.450
It turns out that my publishing house will continue to employ such a woman.

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:44.360
Yes!

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:46.780
You will not regret it! I will work hard!

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:47.870
Excellent.

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:49.230
This is the right attitude!

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:50.450
Then, firstly..

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:53.580
Go and get a story, so that our competitors will burst with envy!

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:55.710
Yes, Chief!

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:02.800
So, she didn't find her fiancee.

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:06.430
Now that I know she didn't find her fiancee,

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:08.800
for some reason I feel relieved.

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:12.810
This kind of thing happened to me because of one woman?!

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:17.810
Impossible.

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:21.150
He's here!

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:24.440
So, he's the one?

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:27.610
The one who beat up dozens of men?

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:29.950
Yes, scary type ...

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:31.200
Excuse me!

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:32.580
Let me through.

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:33.700
What is it?

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:35.660
There is nothing for women to see here.

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:38.290
Don't butt in men's work.

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:40.840
A woman is here? Absolutely insolent!

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:42.420
Hey, you guys.

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:44.550
Aren't you embarrassed?

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:47.840
At Imperial University, women are allowed to listen to lectures.

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:51.300
And now 170,000 women are already working in companies!

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:54.850
Journalists are at the forefront of the era,
and what am I hearing?! Shame on you!

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:56.390
Tamaki!

00:12:56.390 --> 00:12:57.350
Benio.

00:12:57.350 --> 00:12:58.850
Long time no see.

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:01.820
Cheers.

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:04.280
Oh, I see.

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:06.530
You also became a journalist, Tamaki.

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:08.860
I see you're working hard.

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:11.570
Tonight, let's celebrate.

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:12.870
Drink! Drink!

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:18.330
Tamaki, are you okay?

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:20.500
Yes.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:24.460
By the way, it would also be great if UFO appeared right here!

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:26.880
It will definitely become hot news.

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:30.890
Then all those male journalists would fall into despair.

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:32.510
UFO?

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:33.950
Yes!

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:37.770
Unidentified flying object.

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:39.640
A strange flying contraption!

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:40.900
Spaceship!

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:42.200
There's alien in it.

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:43.230
А-а-а!

00:13:43.230 --> 00:13:45.280
Flying thingy right on course!

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:47.530
Tamaki, behind you!

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:49.950
It's flying.

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:51.910
Is that a real UFO?

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:54.660
Oh, no. Did we drink too much?

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.910
People. There's people in there.

00:13:56.910 --> 00:13:58.500
Tamaki, breaking news!

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:00.020
Alien invasion!

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:01.940
Excuse me, let me borrow this.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:04.920
Let's see.

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:07.710
Lieutenant?

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:08.920
Lieutenant!

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:10.930
Lieutenant is on it!

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.930
Benio, come to your senses.

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:14.930
You're probably hallucinating.

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:16.510
It's true.

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:18.140
Tamaki, see for yourself.

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:20.600
It disappeared?

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:25.820
We're hallucinating because we're drunk!

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:27.820
So scary!

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:29.650
Lieutenant is an alien?

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:31.950
It can't be!

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:34.370
What?

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:36.350
UFO's been seen?

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:39.230
Is it because you drank too much that you get drunk?

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.960
I really saw it.

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:43.960
It looked like a rugby ball.

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:47.250
It looked bloated.

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:48.960
And Lieutenant was sitting in it.

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:50.420
And then what happened?

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:52.970
Do you think Lieutenant Ijuin is an alien?

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:54.970
As expected, Chief!

00:14:54.970 --> 00:14:56.100
You guessed right away!

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:56.970
Are you stupid?

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:58.180
Are you playing around?

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:01.310
Big news!

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:03.600
Big news - first time seen in Japan!

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:05.940
An airship has landed in Tokyo!

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:07.860
Last night, on the coast!

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:10.990
Airship? Is it such a balloon
that's inflated with hydrogen?

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:12.990
That's not all.

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:16.770
Do you know who flew on it?
Aristocrats from Russia!

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:18.450
There's two of them. One man and one woman.

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:21.230
A stone's throw from away from us? Let's go.

00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:25.420
That is a Zeppelin.
(A type of rigid airship named after the German Count Ferdinand von Zeppelin)

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:27.420
240 meters in length.

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:29.460
Weighs 100 tons!

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:32.760
That is the UFO I saw yesterday.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:36.260
So, it was not a dream.

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:40.790
The ones who got to Japan on this airship that you see..

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:44.350
are these Russian aristocrats.

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:46.480
Count and Countess Mikhailov.

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:49.570
They had to flee the persecution of the revolutionary government

00:15:49.570 --> 00:15:52.780
and they hope to find a permanent
refuge in our country.

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:58.240
Lieutenant?

00:15:58.240 --> 00:15:59.870
Lieutenant!

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:01.830
Just as I thought. It's the Lieutenant!

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:03.540
He's not Mikhailov!

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:06.150
Dear Japanese friends,

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:08.750
Thank you for welcoming us, husband and wife.

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:10.820
We are truly grateful.

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:14.530
Lieutenant.

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:17.120
Lieutenant.

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:18.300
What is it?

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:19.500
Don't push.

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:29.690
Young lady.

00:16:29.690 --> 00:16:31.690
Are you hurt?

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:33.300
Lieutenant!

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:34.240
I missed you.

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:35.740
It's me. It's Benio.

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:36.740
Lieutenant!

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:38.490
You're Lieutenant, right?

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:39.410
It's me.

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:40.780
Benio.

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:51.990
Malinka..

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:55.720
Malinka?

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:01.510
Larisa!

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:08.440
Her Excellency is not feeling well.

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:11.650
It's all for today. Welcoming ceremony is over.

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:14.280
He said Malinka.

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:16.780
Just as I thought. It's Lieutenant.

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:18.200
But...

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:19.740
Why?

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:22.780
What are you saying?!

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:25.660
That Mikhailov is Lieutenant Ijuin?

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:28.460
Take a look at his face!
He's definitely not Japanese!

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:30.500
Lieutenant is half Japanese.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:33.630
The same face ... The same hair color ...
and the same height.

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:34.920
And also..

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:38.800
He definitely said "Malinka" when he saw me.

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:41.140
This word is known only to the Lieutenant!

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:43.930
That man is definitely Lieutenant!

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:45.930
I knew it.

00:17:45.930 --> 00:17:47.390
Come to your senses!

00:17:47.390 --> 00:17:51.150
If it's really him, then why didn't he recognize you?

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:53.650
Why did he married another woman?

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:57.150
I don't know,

00:17:57.360 --> 00:17:59.150
But...

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:01.160
That man is definitely Lieutenant!

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:05.160
Okay. I know.

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:08.450
Let’s try to find out what kind of man this Count Mikhailov is.

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:11.710
If he actually turns out to be Japanese,

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:12.920
It'll be big news.

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:15.750
Chief. Thank you!

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:21.050
JYODANSHA

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:22.390
So far, the Mikhailovs have stayed in the mansion of Count Tanukikoji.

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:24.760
Maybe we can ask them for an interview?

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:28.730
As far as I know, they do not make contact with the press.
TIt's difficult to get an interview.

00:18:28.730 --> 00:18:32.810
It seems that the government
is arranging a reception in their honor soon.

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:35.190
Unfortunately, the invitations are limited.

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:39.990
Basically there will be important people from the embassy and government, their relatives and so on.

00:18:39.990 --> 00:18:45.200
The program includes comedy by Ryu Koizumi and traditional Japanese dance performed by Ranmaru Fujieda.

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:47.200
So, Ranmaru will be there?

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:48.790
Yay!

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:50.580
I will go!

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:54.960
This person is definitely Lieutenant.

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:56.240
There's no doubt.

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:58.500
Do you really think so, Ranmaru?

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:02.590
How can I forget the rival
for whom I suffered so much!

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:05.640
But how did it happen that he suddenly became a Russian count?

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:07.680
That is what I want to find out!

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:09.220
How?

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:10.980
That is..

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:24.360
Ladies and gentlemen, the concert will start now.

00:19:39.590 --> 00:19:41.260
So, do you see him?

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:43.260
Yes. There's no doubt.

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:45.260
It's the Lieutenant.

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:47.970
Well, of course! Who else could it be!

00:19:47.970 --> 00:19:50.640
So beautiful.

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:56.190
The second act will start in 30 minutes.

00:19:56.190 --> 00:19:58.190
Why am I also here?

00:19:58.500 --> 00:19:59.770
In the meantime, I ask everyone to take a break.

00:19:59.770 --> 00:20:00.940
Do you really see him?

00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:02.740
Yes. There's no doubt.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.300
Then, let's go.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:05.280
This is our chance.

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:08.660
Dear,

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:11.290
I feel bad for everyone, but

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:13.700
but I'd rather rest if you don't mind.

00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:16.210
I need to take the medicine.

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:18.540
Can you bring me water?

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:19.920
Of course.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:22.110
You must be tired from the journey.

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:23.590
Just rest.

00:20:27.930 --> 00:20:30.100
So this is the count and countess' room.

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:31.890
But there is a guard.

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:33.980
I can handle him somehow.

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:36.480
But, how to do it?

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:38.520
That's it.

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:42.000
Me?!

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:43.730
There's nobody else.

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:45.650
Heck!

00:20:45.650 --> 00:20:48.000
Param-pam-pam!

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:49.780
Why am I talking this nonsense ?!

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:52.700
Poor, poor editor!

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:55.330
Bastard! You are suspicious!

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:56.960
Wait!

00:21:02.050 --> 00:21:04.340
Who are you?

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:07.880
This is our room.

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:09.330
I'm sorry.

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:10.800
But...

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:13.890
I really want to meet
Count Mikhailov!

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:15.350
Sasha?

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:16.730
А-а!

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:19.350
This is the girl from the press conference!

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:20.440
Umm..

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:21.900
Excuse me, but..

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:24.980
Perhaps the Count is someone I know...

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:27.780
Such arrogance!

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:31.120
Sasha Mikhailov is a Russian blue blood!

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:34.490
It’s impossible that he met with someone like you.

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:41.670
This photo...

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:45.800
That is our wedding photo.

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:47.380
Do you understand now?

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:50.260
Sasha is not someone you knew.

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:54.140
I'm sorry.

00:21:54.140 --> 00:21:55.390
Excuse me.

00:21:55.390 --> 00:21:58.230
Don't ever come back here.

00:21:59.390 --> 00:22:00.980
That's not Lieutenant.

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:04.190
They look so much alike.

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:05.690
It's not him.

00:22:09.570 --> 00:22:11.700
Sorry to keep you waiting, Larisa.

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:14.370
Did something happen?

00:22:15.620 --> 00:22:17.410
No, nothing.

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:18.750
Thank you.

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:21.710
I love you, my dear.

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:25.880
So that's it.

00:22:25.880 --> 00:22:27.760
We were mistaken.

00:22:27.760 --> 00:22:29.420
Well, okay.

00:22:29.630 --> 00:22:32.550
If you took it as given, it’s for the better.

00:22:33.140 --> 00:22:34.800
Chief.

00:22:35.060 --> 00:22:39.430
Just believe with all your heart, and you’ll definitely
meet him someday!

00:22:39.600 --> 00:22:41.230
Let's go back to the office.

00:22:41.230 --> 00:22:42.340
Yes.

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:47.440
Tosei-san.

00:22:49.440 --> 00:22:51.450
If it isn't Tosei-san.

00:22:51.450 --> 00:22:53.780
So you've come.

00:22:54.990 --> 00:22:56.660
That's a good thing.

00:22:56.660 --> 00:22:58.540
Let me introduce you.

00:22:58.540 --> 00:23:01.460
This is Tsumeko Fukurokoji-sama.

00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:04.290
Your marriage partner.

00:23:04.290 --> 00:23:06.690
Let's quickly arrange for the wedding.

00:23:14.220 --> 00:23:16.640
That is wonderful news.

00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:18.600
But unfortunately,

00:23:18.600 --> 00:23:20.980
my heart already belongs to another!

00:23:20.980 --> 00:23:23.480
to this Hanamura Benio-san.

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:25.480
So please forgive me.

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:29.110
It hurts!

00:23:29.480 --> 00:23:31.930
She’s one of those ... the working class ...

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:35.490
Okay, let's properly talk about this later.

00:23:35.660 --> 00:23:39.240
Sometimes show your face at home.

00:23:41.160 --> 00:23:42.580
Oh, goodness.

00:23:42.580 --> 00:23:45.920
Chief, please don't lie.

00:23:45.920 --> 00:23:48.710
The person your heart is set on is me?

00:23:49.140 --> 00:23:52.660
But if I don't say that, she will not give up.

00:23:53.130 --> 00:23:54.220
Listen,

00:23:54.220 --> 00:23:56.390
Let's date for a bit.

00:23:56.800 --> 00:23:59.760
That'll be my pleasure!

00:24:00.810 --> 00:24:03.690
ODEN

00:24:00.850 --> 00:24:01.970
What?!

00:24:01.970 --> 00:24:03.980
That was your mother?

00:24:03.980 --> 00:24:06.520
But she's so young.. and beautiful.

00:24:06.520 --> 00:24:07.980
I can't believe it.

00:24:07.980 --> 00:24:09.900
How about this?

00:24:09.900 --> 00:24:12.740
I can believe it now. You look just like her.

00:24:12.740 --> 00:24:15.530
Mother gave birth to me when she was 16 years old.

00:24:15.860 --> 00:24:17.930
She's from a family of impoverished nobles.

00:24:17.930 --> 00:24:20.790
Father is a nouveau riche banker who has grown rich in an upstart.

00:24:20.790 --> 00:24:24.810
In short, the family sold
their princess for money.

00:24:25.540 --> 00:24:29.540
Mom still hasn’t forgotten this,
and she is very cold towards my father.

00:24:29.540 --> 00:24:33.550
Father adores her and constantly fawns over her.

00:24:33.550 --> 00:24:35.550
He fulfills her every whim.

00:24:36.080 --> 00:24:38.430
Mother had a lover.

00:24:38.580 --> 00:24:41.560
When the marriage was set, she was already pregnant..

00:24:42.220 --> 00:24:44.230
.. with me.

00:24:44.230 --> 00:24:47.560
Even so, my father loved me very much.

00:24:47.560 --> 00:24:50.820
But that made things even more hard for me.

00:24:50.820 --> 00:24:54.940
They reminded me all the time,
that I'm a child of sin, and it was unbearable.

00:24:54.940 --> 00:24:57.360
That's why I left home.

00:24:57.360 --> 00:25:01.120
I look like my Mother, so
I'm disgusted to look at myself.

00:25:02.280 --> 00:25:05.200
Sorry, you had to listen to my boring drunken chatter.

00:25:05.880 --> 00:25:07.160
Forget about it.

00:25:07.780 --> 00:25:09.170
Chief!

00:25:09.170 --> 00:25:10.920
I had no idea.

00:25:10.920 --> 00:25:14.510
Chief, how difficult it was for you!

00:25:14.510 --> 00:25:15.970
So pitiful.

00:25:15.970 --> 00:25:18.430
Chief, poor you.

00:25:18.430 --> 00:25:20.800
There's no reason for you to cry.

00:25:20.800 --> 00:25:23.100
But you're so pitiful.

00:25:26.270 --> 00:25:29.150
What was it?! Drunken tears ?!

00:25:29.980 --> 00:25:33.610
I thought to console her, but it turned out the other way around.

00:25:34.190 --> 00:25:35.610
All right.

00:25:35.610 --> 00:25:37.970
You're a good person, Hanamura.

00:25:39.160 --> 00:25:41.620
What is this feeling?

00:25:42.740 --> 00:25:44.990
There really is no hives.

00:25:44.990 --> 00:25:46.410
Which means...

00:25:46.410 --> 00:25:48.210
Maybe I..

00:25:48.750 --> 00:25:52.940
love this woman ?!

00:25:53.630 --> 00:25:56.960
You must be kidding me.

00:26:02.800 --> 00:26:04.350
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:26:04.350 --> 00:26:06.600
I see you have become an early bird!

00:26:06.600 --> 00:26:08.270
Hey, Miss Journalist.

00:26:08.270 --> 00:26:09.940
Onijima-san!

00:26:10.980 --> 00:26:12.560
When did you come to Japan?

00:26:12.560 --> 00:26:14.150
I just arrived.

00:26:14.150 --> 00:26:18.440
During the time that we did not see each other, I traveled around
the border of Siberia and found out something.

00:26:18.440 --> 00:26:23.660
I found a picture of that Russian, Sasha Mikhailov. He looks like Lieutenant.

00:26:23.660 --> 00:26:25.660
Are you talking about Count Mikhailov?

00:26:25.660 --> 00:26:26.490
Yes.

00:26:26.490 --> 00:26:28.410
I found out..

00:26:28.410 --> 00:26:31.670
Sasha, his wife Larisa and mother Elina

00:26:31.670 --> 00:26:36.240
fled from the advancing Red Army
and reached Siberia.

00:26:36.240 --> 00:26:39.670
Along the way, Elina fell in and died.

00:26:40.720 --> 00:26:42.470
My condolence.

00:26:42.470 --> 00:26:45.680
Count Mikhailov's mother..

00:26:45.680 --> 00:26:48.970
No, that's not all.

00:26:48.970 --> 00:26:51.000
That Elina

00:26:51.000 --> 00:26:54.050
is actually the Lieutenant’s mother.

00:26:54.050 --> 00:26:54.690
What?!

00:26:54.690 --> 00:26:56.110
Lieutenant's..

00:26:56.780 --> 00:26:58.110
Come to think about it.

00:26:58.110 --> 00:27:01.960
Lieutenant's mother left him and got married somewhere abroad.

00:27:01.960 --> 00:27:03.110
Yes.

00:27:03.110 --> 00:27:06.740
Russian emmigrant Sasha Mikhailov and the Lieutenant

00:27:06.740 --> 00:27:09.120
are brothers from different father.

00:27:09.120 --> 00:27:11.210
The Lieutenant and the Count...

00:27:11.210 --> 00:27:13.710
But they looked like each other.

00:27:13.960 --> 00:27:16.210
So it's not the Lieutenant.

00:27:16.210 --> 00:27:17.710
Unbelievable.

00:27:17.960 --> 00:27:19.710
So that was it?

00:27:20.300 --> 00:27:21.380
Onijima-san.

00:27:21.380 --> 00:27:24.050
Did you come to Japan just for this?

00:27:24.050 --> 00:27:28.140
Yes. I want to find out a bit more about Sasha Mikhailov.

00:27:28.140 --> 00:27:30.770
If I find out anything else, l'll let you know.

00:27:30.770 --> 00:27:32.810
Thank you, Onijima san.

00:27:32.810 --> 00:27:33.980
See you later.

00:27:33.980 --> 00:27:36.270
Good luck in your work!

00:27:38.440 --> 00:27:41.280
Letters for Editor-in-Chief!

00:27:41.280 --> 00:27:42.530
Throw them all away!

00:27:42.900 --> 00:27:44.310
Eh? But..

00:27:44.400 --> 00:27:45.160
Yes!

00:27:45.740 --> 00:27:47.740
I know who they're from.

00:27:49.950 --> 00:27:50.790
All of these..

00:27:50.790 --> 00:27:53.750
are love letters from Sumeko-san!

00:27:53.750 --> 00:27:55.750
I bet it's all my mother's idea.

00:27:55.750 --> 00:28:00.340
No matter how many times I tell her that I already have someone I love, she won't listen.

00:28:00.750 --> 00:28:02.880
That's so unlike you.

00:28:02.880 --> 00:28:05.760
How long are you going to play along?

00:28:06.180 --> 00:28:08.040
You're also putting me in an awkward position!

00:28:08.040 --> 00:28:12.000
You must clearly refuse,
including for the sake of that girl!

00:28:12.600 --> 00:28:15.770
But what am I supposed to do if it's true?

00:28:18.980 --> 00:28:20.610
I like you.

00:28:20.610 --> 00:28:21.780
I love you.

00:28:21.780 --> 00:28:23.240
I think..

00:28:23.240 --> 00:28:25.280
Wh.. Wh...

00:28:25.280 --> 00:28:26.910
What?! That's a lie!

00:28:26.910 --> 00:28:28.800
Unfortunately, it's true.

00:28:28.800 --> 00:28:30.490
It can't be.

00:28:31.200 --> 00:28:35.500
You have got to be kidding me!

00:28:39.460 --> 00:28:43.300
Chief has feelings for me.

00:28:43.300 --> 00:28:45.800
It can't be.
Shame on you!

00:28:45.800 --> 00:28:48.300
I'm Lieutenant's fiancee.

00:28:48.300 --> 00:28:50.920
And where is that Ijuin now?

00:28:53.390 --> 00:28:55.560
My words may sound cruel,

00:28:56.060 --> 00:29:00.210
most likely means that your fiancé is already dead.

00:29:00.210 --> 00:29:03.610
He has no right to bind you to himself for life!

00:29:03.610 --> 00:29:07.450
He must not take away your freedom!

00:29:08.590 --> 00:29:11.980
Of course, you don't need to answer me now.

00:29:11.980 --> 00:29:17.830
Someday, when his shadow disappears from your heart..

00:29:17.830 --> 00:29:22.840
When that time comes,if you remember me, then that's fine.

00:29:24.710 --> 00:29:27.300
Chief is a good person.

00:29:28.280 --> 00:29:31.850
You can't see it at first glance,
but actually he's a very kind person.

00:29:31.850 --> 00:29:34.810
I like Chief too.

00:29:36.180 --> 00:29:39.600
If I never meet Lieutenant,

00:29:39.600 --> 00:29:41.860
maybe...

00:29:43.860 --> 00:29:46.320
It's really awkward.

00:29:46.740 --> 00:29:48.400
Lieutenant...

00:29:48.400 --> 00:29:50.740
If only you were here.

00:29:59.870 --> 00:30:00.960
Lieutenant!

00:30:00.960 --> 00:30:02.840
Lieutenant!

00:30:02.840 --> 00:30:04.340
Lieutenant!

00:30:04.340 --> 00:30:05.880
Lieutenant!

00:30:05.880 --> 00:30:07.550
Lieutenant!

00:30:07.550 --> 00:30:09.880
Lieutenant!

00:30:09.880 --> 00:30:13.910
Where have I heard that woman's voice?

00:30:14.430 --> 00:30:15.890
I don't know.

00:30:15.890 --> 00:30:17.390
Why...

00:30:18.180 --> 00:30:22.770
When I try to think about it, my mind becomes hazy.

00:30:23.150 --> 00:30:24.570
Sasha?

00:30:24.570 --> 00:30:26.730
You're still awake at this late hour?

00:30:26.730 --> 00:30:27.900
It's nothing.

00:30:27.900 --> 00:30:29.900
I just can't fall asleep.

00:30:30.530 --> 00:30:32.780
You should rest a bit more.

00:30:32.780 --> 00:30:35.660
You're still tired from the journey.

00:30:35.660 --> 00:30:38.580
Suddenly, I have a bad feeling.

00:30:38.580 --> 00:30:41.920
That you're going to go somewhere.

00:30:42.170 --> 00:30:43.210
Please!

00:30:43.210 --> 00:30:45.500
Don't leave me alone.

00:30:45.500 --> 00:30:47.670
Stay by my side.

00:30:47.670 --> 00:30:49.920
Till I fall asleep.

00:30:49.920 --> 00:30:52.340
Okay, Larisa.

00:30:54.890 --> 00:30:57.220
Dear, forgive me.

00:30:57.220 --> 00:30:59.180
What are you saying?

00:30:59.180 --> 00:31:01.560
I'm your husband.

00:31:01.560 --> 00:31:03.480
Sweet dreams.

00:31:27.100 --> 00:31:29.710
What is this place?

00:31:29.960 --> 00:31:32.630
For some reason, it seems familiar to me.

00:31:39.970 --> 00:31:41.980
It's already morning.

00:31:43.350 --> 00:31:45.440
This place also..

00:31:45.440 --> 00:31:46.800
This road..

00:31:46.800 --> 00:31:49.110
But why?

00:31:53.280 --> 00:31:57.240
Good morning, Tenmaru! Chimaru!

00:32:00.950 --> 00:32:03.330
Good morning, our tree.

00:32:05.290 --> 00:32:07.330
No.

00:32:07.330 --> 00:32:10.380
I remember it somehow.

00:32:10.380 --> 00:32:12.260
This house..

00:32:12.260 --> 00:32:14.160
I remember that!

00:32:14.170 --> 00:32:15.680
But why?

00:32:16.220 --> 00:32:18.470
I grew up in Russia.

00:32:18.470 --> 00:32:21.520
I don't know anything about Japan.

00:32:22.720 --> 00:32:25.590
On this tree, Lieutenant and I..

00:32:28.600 --> 00:32:30.480
But why is it..

00:32:30.480 --> 00:32:32.730
it seems as if it was just yesterday.

00:32:48.520 --> 00:32:50.070
Tenmaru?

00:32:50.220 --> 00:32:51.550
Chimaru?

00:32:53.200 --> 00:32:56.970
How do I know these dogs' names?

00:32:58.470 --> 00:33:01.840
I know this house.

00:33:01.840 --> 00:33:03.720
This is my home!

00:33:07.100 --> 00:33:09.150
This tree...

00:33:12.690 --> 00:33:14.860
Count Mikhailov?

00:33:15.940 --> 00:33:18.990
But these two dogs didn't recognize anyone but the Lieutenant!

00:33:20.570 --> 00:33:22.400
It couldn't be!

00:33:36.920 --> 00:33:39.890
Benio...san?

00:33:40.970 --> 00:33:42.480
That's right.

00:33:42.480 --> 00:33:45.900
Your name is Benio-san.

00:33:47.180 --> 00:33:48.520
Lieutenant...

00:33:50.310 --> 00:33:52.440
Again?

00:33:52.730 --> 00:33:54.110
Benio-san.

00:33:55.080 --> 00:33:56.360
That's right.

00:33:56.360 --> 00:33:57.650
I'm Lieutenant.

00:33:57.650 --> 00:33:59.400
Ijuin Shinobu.

00:33:59.400 --> 00:34:00.950
Lieutenant!

00:34:00.950 --> 00:34:02.620
Is it really you?

00:34:02.620 --> 00:34:04.120
Lieutenant!

00:34:04.120 --> 00:34:05.580
Lieutenant!!!

00:34:05.580 --> 00:34:08.460
You really are alive, Lieutenant!

00:34:10.380 --> 00:34:11.710
Benio-san!

00:34:11.710 --> 00:34:12.940
I...

00:34:13.460 --> 00:34:15.300
In Siberia...

00:34:15.300 --> 00:34:18.130
That attack of the Cossacks...

00:34:18.640 --> 00:34:20.130
Larisa...

00:34:20.590 --> 00:34:21.760
That's it!

00:34:22.040 --> 00:34:24.140
Larisa saved me.

00:34:24.140 --> 00:34:25.680
And then...

00:34:26.210 --> 00:34:27.680
That time, I ..

00:34:27.680 --> 00:34:29.740
lost my memory.

00:34:30.480 --> 00:34:32.600
But now I've returned here.

00:34:32.600 --> 00:34:35.400
Benio-san, I really missed you!

00:34:35.770 --> 00:34:37.400
It's Lieutenant!

00:34:37.400 --> 00:34:38.690
It's Lieutenant!

00:34:38.690 --> 00:34:40.150
It really is him!

00:34:42.160 --> 00:34:45.620
We finally met!

00:34:51.420 --> 00:34:53.130
Thank god.

00:34:53.130 --> 00:34:55.840
Everyone will be so glad.

00:34:55.840 --> 00:34:58.420
Let's go home, Lieutenant.

00:34:58.420 --> 00:34:59.840
Grandpa..

00:34:59.840 --> 00:35:01.340
Grandma!

00:35:07.560 --> 00:35:08.850
What is it?

00:35:08.850 --> 00:35:10.230
Lieutenant?

00:35:10.980 --> 00:35:12.480
Benio-san.

00:35:12.480 --> 00:35:14.190
Not now.

00:35:15.440 --> 00:35:17.920
Please give me time.

00:35:22.490 --> 00:35:24.200
Lieutenant.

00:35:24.200 --> 00:35:25.820
Why?

00:35:29.370 --> 00:35:30.950
I'm Japanese.

00:35:30.950 --> 00:35:32.540
Ijuin Shinobu!

00:35:32.540 --> 00:35:35.380
But then why did I become Mikhailov?

00:35:35.750 --> 00:35:38.210
I have to talk to Larisa and find out everything!

00:35:38.210 --> 00:35:41.470
And then I will tell her everything!

00:35:41.470 --> 00:35:43.880
I have to become myself again!

00:35:45.260 --> 00:35:47.930
Larisa, we have to talk.

00:35:47.930 --> 00:35:49.100
Larisa!

00:35:49.100 --> 00:35:50.720
Larisa!

00:35:50.720 --> 00:35:51.730
Larisa!

00:35:51.730 --> 00:35:53.140
Hold on!

00:35:53.140 --> 00:35:54.020
Blood?

00:35:54.020 --> 00:35:56.650
Call the doctor!

00:36:01.280 --> 00:36:05.470
Against this illness, medicine is ineffective.

00:36:05.780 --> 00:36:10.310
Forgive me for having to say this, but her condition is very grave.

00:36:11.240 --> 00:36:13.750
I will leave the nurse here.

00:36:13.750 --> 00:36:15.500
Take good care of her.

00:36:18.920 --> 00:36:20.250
Larisa.

00:36:20.540 --> 00:36:23.000
How did this happen?

00:36:23.420 --> 00:36:25.840
I'm sorry.

00:36:25.840 --> 00:36:29.390
Finally, we've arrived in a country,
where we are not in danger anymore.

00:36:29.390 --> 00:36:32.270
We should have lived happily here.

00:36:32.270 --> 00:36:35.810
You have nothing to worry about anymore!

00:36:35.810 --> 00:36:39.610
The main thing is to be treated properly.
Then you’ll definitely get better.

00:36:39.610 --> 00:36:42.280
Larisa, I ...

00:36:42.980 --> 00:36:44.950
What is it?

00:36:44.950 --> 00:36:47.570
No. Nothing.

00:36:47.570 --> 00:36:48.620
You're lying.

00:36:48.620 --> 00:36:51.330
You're hiding something.

00:36:52.490 --> 00:36:53.580
Dear!

00:36:53.580 --> 00:36:55.500
You've regained your memory?

00:36:56.870 --> 00:36:58.710
That's it, isn't it?

00:36:58.710 --> 00:37:00.960
The girl who recognized you ...

00:37:00.960 --> 00:37:02.820
Is she any relation to you at all?

00:37:04.840 --> 00:37:06.300
Larisa!

00:37:06.590 --> 00:37:07.930
Calm down.

00:37:07.930 --> 00:37:10.100
You'll get worse.

00:37:10.100 --> 00:37:12.310
Nothing happened at all.

00:37:12.310 --> 00:37:14.890
You have to get some rest.

00:37:16.310 --> 00:37:17.770
Dear...

00:37:17.770 --> 00:37:19.600
Forgive me, please.

00:37:19.600 --> 00:37:23.530
I'm a terrible woman.

00:37:25.200 --> 00:37:27.400
Larisa is barely alive.

00:37:27.400 --> 00:37:30.320
Now I can’t tell her anything.

00:37:31.240 --> 00:37:32.740
Benio-san.

00:37:32.740 --> 00:37:35.330
My precious Benio-san!

00:37:36.330 --> 00:37:39.540
I thought we would always be together.

00:37:39.540 --> 00:37:41.920
And yet..

00:37:44.240 --> 00:37:45.630
Lieutenant?

00:37:47.470 --> 00:37:48.930
Onijima?

00:37:49.260 --> 00:37:50.340
Onijima!

00:37:50.340 --> 00:37:51.890
Is it really you?

00:37:51.890 --> 00:37:53.560
Sergeant Onijima?!

00:37:53.560 --> 00:37:55.220
Lieutenant?

00:37:55.220 --> 00:37:57.850
So you really are the Lieutenant?

00:37:57.850 --> 00:38:00.940
Onijima, you survived then!

00:38:01.350 --> 00:38:02.810
Lieutenant!

00:38:02.810 --> 00:38:06.740
Not a day passed that I didn't think about you!

00:38:06.740 --> 00:38:09.450
After all, you sacrificed your life for me!

00:38:09.450 --> 00:38:13.520
Onijima, I'm glad you're alive.

00:38:14.780 --> 00:38:20.370
I wanted to see Sasha Mikhailov closely, so I decided to sneak up unnoticed.

00:38:20.370 --> 00:38:23.840
By the way, Lieutenant, why did you suddenly became Russian?

00:38:25.550 --> 00:38:28.380
Did Benio-san already know about this?

00:38:29.260 --> 00:38:32.200
So you've met Benio-san, Onijima?

00:38:32.200 --> 00:38:33.390
Yes.

00:38:33.390 --> 00:38:36.790
I was a mounted bandit in Manchuria.

00:38:36.790 --> 00:38:40.730
Benio-san went there to find you.

00:38:40.730 --> 00:38:41.940
I see.

00:38:41.940 --> 00:38:45.930
Benio-san went that far to find me.

00:38:45.930 --> 00:38:47.360
Lieutenant,

00:38:47.360 --> 00:38:50.400
You must immediately drop everything
and run back to Benio-san!

00:38:50.400 --> 00:38:52.740
You have no place here.

00:38:53.280 --> 00:38:55.530
If only that's possible.

00:38:57.790 --> 00:39:00.110
Mikhailov-sama, your wife is ..

00:39:00.110 --> 00:39:01.370
Larisa!

00:39:06.170 --> 00:39:09.920
This is the reason, Onijima.

00:39:09.920 --> 00:39:11.300
The woman is ..

00:39:11.680 --> 00:39:13.870
Sasha Mikhailov's wife.

00:39:14.430 --> 00:39:17.600
Onijima, do you remember how it was?

00:39:17.600 --> 00:39:21.310
On that day,during the Siberian snowstorm

00:39:23.160 --> 00:39:26.440
My life would have been lost in the whirlwind.

00:39:26.440 --> 00:39:28.440
if at that time

00:39:28.440 --> 00:39:31.780
Larisa didn't find me,

00:39:32.860 --> 00:39:35.370
I was between life and death.

00:39:35.580 --> 00:39:39.940
The fever was so high that then I couldn’t even remember my own name.

00:39:40.750 --> 00:39:43.620
And when Larisa looked at me ...

00:39:43.620 --> 00:39:46.460
You see, she was very attached to her husband.

00:39:46.460 --> 00:39:48.460
and saw in me a replacement for Sasha.

00:39:48.460 --> 00:39:51.420
She taught me to speak and explained everything to me.

00:39:51.740 --> 00:39:55.550
As a result, I began to consider myself as Sasha.

00:39:57.640 --> 00:40:00.100
So it was like that.

00:40:01.180 --> 00:40:05.960
In addition, Sasha Mikhailov
turned out to be my younger brother,

00:40:06.730 --> 00:40:09.820
me and my brother looked alike

00:40:09.960 --> 00:40:12.490
So Larisa turned me into him.

00:40:14.490 --> 00:40:16.490
Larisa saved my life.

00:40:16.490 --> 00:40:20.490
If she wasn't there, I would have died.

00:40:21.290 --> 00:40:24.500
And now she has also lost her homeland.

00:40:24.500 --> 00:40:27.670
In a strange, unfamiliar country,
she suffers from a serious illness.

00:40:28.290 --> 00:40:36.080
I can't leave her now.

00:40:36.080 --> 00:40:39.640
Lieutenant, I understand you perfectly.

00:40:39.640 --> 00:40:42.520
But, what about Benio-san?

00:40:42.520 --> 00:40:45.890
You still love Benio-san!

00:40:45.890 --> 00:40:47.350
It's true.

00:40:47.350 --> 00:40:49.980
I love Benio-san.

00:40:49.980 --> 00:40:51.650
Then, why?

00:40:51.650 --> 00:40:54.530
What about yourself ?!

00:40:55.700 --> 00:40:57.950
I love Benio-san so much.

00:40:58.530 --> 00:41:00.530
But, we probably

00:41:00.700 --> 00:41:04.330
will not be able to return to that happy time.

00:41:06.540 --> 00:41:07.540
Seriously?!

00:41:07.540 --> 00:41:10.340
Count Mikhailov is your Lieutenant?

00:41:10.340 --> 00:41:13.460
Yes. He recognized me too.

00:41:13.460 --> 00:41:15.070
I don't understand.

00:41:15.070 --> 00:41:17.130
Why did he impersonate another person?

00:41:17.130 --> 00:41:22.180
I think the Lieutenant has his own reasons for this.

00:41:22.180 --> 00:41:23.390
So it's here?

00:41:23.390 --> 00:41:25.250
Hey, you shouldn't barge in here!

00:41:25.250 --> 00:41:27.520
I can answer that question.

00:41:27.520 --> 00:41:29.100
Onijima-san!

00:41:30.770 --> 00:41:32.570
He lost his memory?!

00:41:32.570 --> 00:41:34.150
It couldn't be!

00:41:34.150 --> 00:41:38.280
So, Lieutenant forgot about me and the family...

00:41:38.570 --> 00:41:40.120
This kind of thing...

00:41:40.120 --> 00:41:42.580
He became a different person against his will.

00:41:42.580 --> 00:41:44.910
A lot has happened.

00:41:44.910 --> 00:41:48.870
I think the Lieutenant will sooner or later
tell you eveything.

00:41:48.870 --> 00:41:50.580
Sooner or later?!

00:41:50.790 --> 00:41:53.500
How many years do you think Hanamura waited for him?

00:41:53.500 --> 00:41:57.760
I don’t know whether it's amnesia or not, but he married another woman!

00:41:57.760 --> 00:41:59.470
He crossed the line!

00:41:59.470 --> 00:42:01.760
Who the hell are you ?!

00:42:01.760 --> 00:42:03.220
Mind your own business!

00:42:03.220 --> 00:42:04.600
What?!

00:42:05.240 --> 00:42:07.560
Chief! Onijima-san!

00:42:07.560 --> 00:42:09.980
Stop it, the both of you!

00:42:13.320 --> 00:42:16.610
I have to find out everything myself.

00:42:16.610 --> 00:42:19.570
What should I tell the Lieutenant when I meet him?

00:42:19.570 --> 00:42:22.990
Aah, no! Still too scary.

00:42:27.580 --> 00:42:28.980
Larisa-san.

00:42:30.620 --> 00:42:33.380
She has so quickly became so haggard.

00:42:33.380 --> 00:42:35.750
So, the illness is really serious.

00:42:39.200 --> 00:42:41.240
Lieutenant!

00:42:43.180 --> 00:42:46.220
Why did I even come here?

00:42:46.220 --> 00:42:49.560
To become even more miserable?

00:42:49.560 --> 00:42:53.980
Lieutenant is not only mine anymore.

00:42:53.980 --> 00:42:56.650
Why did I come here to confirm this?

00:43:12.670 --> 00:43:13.940
Lieutenant?

00:43:13.940 --> 00:43:16.670
So you were at this kind of place?

00:43:16.670 --> 00:43:19.130
Lieutenant!

00:43:28.060 --> 00:43:29.220
Lieutenant...

00:43:29.220 --> 00:43:30.180
Wait!

00:43:30.400 --> 00:43:31.390
Lieutenant!

00:43:31.390 --> 00:43:32.500
No!

00:43:32.500 --> 00:43:34.270
Don't go!

00:43:34.270 --> 00:43:35.750
Lieutenant!

00:43:37.610 --> 00:43:39.010
A dream.

00:43:41.780 --> 00:43:44.700
I’ll go collect the invoice.

00:43:45.320 --> 00:43:48.700
Hey, why are you marching there ?! Are you okay?!

00:43:48.700 --> 00:43:50.000
I'm okay!

00:43:52.960 --> 00:43:55.420
Sorry! Sorry!

00:43:55.880 --> 00:43:57.540
That idiot!

00:43:57.540 --> 00:43:59.420
She's incorrigible!

00:43:59.750 --> 00:44:01.590
But that's okay.

00:44:01.590 --> 00:44:05.430
But that Ijuin is a complete idiot.

00:44:05.740 --> 00:44:06.720
Well.

00:44:06.720 --> 00:44:11.100
No matter how stupid he is, it would be necessary to personally pay a visit to His Excellency.

00:44:11.770 --> 00:44:14.350
Aoe ... Tosei.

00:44:14.730 --> 00:44:16.400
Lieutenant Ijuin.

00:44:16.600 --> 00:44:19.110
Is your wife feeling better?

00:44:19.110 --> 00:44:22.220
I see that you are well aware of me.

00:44:22.220 --> 00:44:23.490
And you are?

00:44:23.490 --> 00:44:25.530
Hanamura Benio.

00:44:26.740 --> 00:44:28.740
I'm her boss.

00:44:28.740 --> 00:44:31.270
I also want to marry her.

00:44:31.270 --> 00:44:33.200
You want to marry Benio-san?

00:44:33.200 --> 00:44:34.410
Bastard!

00:44:34.410 --> 00:44:37.880
I already told her about my intentions.

00:44:37.880 --> 00:44:39.210
But ..

00:44:39.210 --> 00:44:43.550
I didn’t want to break into her heart shamelessly,

00:44:44.340 --> 00:44:47.390
Because in her heart, there's you.

00:44:48.760 --> 00:44:52.770
But it seems that this can be ignored.

00:44:53.140 --> 00:44:54.770
Besides...

00:44:54.770 --> 00:44:58.770
I won’t forgive you if you hurt her anymore!

00:44:58.770 --> 00:45:00.770
And these are not empty threats.

00:45:02.280 --> 00:45:04.360
Nothing to say?

00:45:06.200 --> 00:45:07.530
Aoe-san.

00:45:08.450 --> 00:45:10.410
You don't understand.

00:45:13.150 --> 00:45:14.600
You bastard!

00:45:14.600 --> 00:45:17.460
I won't allow such talk about the Lieutenant!

00:45:17.460 --> 00:45:19.290
Onijima, stop it.

00:45:19.290 --> 00:45:21.170
You wouldn't know.

00:45:21.170 --> 00:45:24.910
Do you even understand what we experienced while our troops
wandered around the damn Siberia?

00:45:24.910 --> 00:45:28.800
What do you think it cost us to survive over there ?!

00:45:28.800 --> 00:45:32.390
Bastard! While you were chilling in Tokyo ...

00:45:32.390 --> 00:45:34.270
Onijima, stop it!

00:45:35.250 --> 00:45:38.810
Aoe-san, I took your words into account.

00:45:39.080 --> 00:45:40.810
Now, please leave.

00:45:40.900 --> 00:45:42.520
I'm glad we understood each other.

00:45:42.520 --> 00:45:43.940
Excuse me.

00:45:47.950 --> 00:45:49.990
Aoe Tosei.

00:45:49.990 --> 00:45:52.830
For Benio-san’s sake, he’s really ready for anything.

00:45:53.160 --> 00:45:54.830
He's a good guy.

00:45:55.100 --> 00:45:57.520
I envy him more and more.

00:45:58.100 --> 00:46:02.130
Such a man would undoubtedly be able to protect Benio-san.

00:46:02.900 --> 00:46:04.550
Lieutenant!

00:46:05.210 --> 00:46:06.840
And all that remains for me

00:46:07.160 --> 00:46:11.470
is to protect her happiness from afar.

00:46:13.200 --> 00:46:14.180
What?!

00:46:14.180 --> 00:46:16.640
You're moving out from the Ijuin mansion?

00:46:16.640 --> 00:46:18.140
What are you saying?

00:46:18.140 --> 00:46:20.850
You shouldn't move out from there.

00:46:20.850 --> 00:46:26.110
But, as long as I stay there, the Lieutenant won't be able to return home.

00:46:26.110 --> 00:46:27.610
You surprise me.

00:46:27.610 --> 00:46:32.570
It turns out this lady deceived Shinobu-san
and made him her husband.

00:46:32.570 --> 00:46:36.160
If it was me,I would break into her place and bring him back!

00:46:36.540 --> 00:46:40.870
But if I do that, Larisa-san will
have to stay in Japan all alone.

00:46:41.900 --> 00:46:46.550
Widowed, sick, helpless ...

00:46:46.550 --> 00:46:49.620
And if I take the Lieutenant away from her...

00:46:50.300 --> 00:46:54.180
And then the Lieutenant will be tormented all his life.

00:46:54.180 --> 00:46:57.350
Oh ... That's right, but ...

00:46:58.890 --> 00:47:01.980
Aah... Still, I don't like it.

00:47:01.980 --> 00:47:04.310
I gave up on Shinobu-san because it's you.

00:47:04.540 --> 00:47:07.570
And I’m not ready to give it to some unknown woman!

00:47:07.570 --> 00:47:08.900
I'm sorry, Tamaki.

00:47:09.110 --> 00:47:11.820
Why are you apologizing?

00:47:12.160 --> 00:47:13.530
Jeez.

00:47:13.530 --> 00:47:16.530
You really are hopeless.

00:47:17.290 --> 00:47:20.330
But I love that side of you, Benio.

00:47:20.330 --> 00:47:22.920
I'm glad you're my friend, Tamaki.

00:47:22.920 --> 00:47:26.920
Now,it seems I can honestly let the Lieutenant go.

00:47:26.920 --> 00:47:28.920
What do you mean?

00:47:30.170 --> 00:47:31.880
You see, I have ...

00:47:31.880 --> 00:47:34.930
Tamaki, Ranmaru, Ushigoro and even the Chief!

00:47:34.930 --> 00:47:37.890
So many people who I love!

00:47:39.810 --> 00:47:42.140
I'm absolutely happy!

00:47:42.730 --> 00:47:48.190
In the end, you and Shinobu-san are so much alike.

00:47:52.700 --> 00:47:54.950
Wait a minute! Stop, please!

00:47:57.370 --> 00:48:00.950
Good afternoon, Mikhailov-sama.

00:48:00.950 --> 00:48:02.710
Benio-san.

00:48:02.710 --> 00:48:04.540
How are you?

00:48:04.540 --> 00:48:06.960
Do you have any business with me?

00:48:07.170 --> 00:48:08.290
Yes.

00:48:10.280 --> 00:48:13.340
Do you want to go on a date with me?

00:48:13.340 --> 00:48:14.680
A date?

00:48:15.930 --> 00:48:17.510
Sounds good.

00:48:17.510 --> 00:48:20.720
I also wanted to meet with you.

00:48:20.720 --> 00:48:23.730
So then, where should we go?

00:48:24.230 --> 00:48:26.980
Why don't we go to the coffee shop where we used to drink coffee at?

00:48:34.240 --> 00:48:35.950
A memorable place.

00:48:35.950 --> 00:48:38.570
This cafe has not changed at all.

00:48:38.570 --> 00:48:41.370
You too, Benio-san.

00:48:41.990 --> 00:48:44.370
You are also  the same as before.

00:48:44.550 --> 00:48:46.610
Just like the Lieutenat I know.

00:48:48.000 --> 00:48:49.420
Just like before.

00:48:49.600 --> 00:48:52.110
As if we were back in those days.

00:48:54.920 --> 00:48:58.000
And you still ride a bicycle.

00:48:58.000 --> 00:49:00.470
No. I don't ride anymore.

00:49:00.470 --> 00:49:03.290
This college students ride it now.

00:49:05.180 --> 00:49:07.350
Today is an exception.

00:49:07.350 --> 00:49:09.320
I'm already an adult.

00:49:09.400 --> 00:49:11.180
I see.

00:49:12.530 --> 00:49:13.860
Benio-san.

00:49:14.320 --> 00:49:17.610
Do you know where I went today?

00:49:17.610 --> 00:49:19.620
You didn't know, right?

00:49:20.410 --> 00:49:23.490
I took Larisa’s jewelries to a jeweler in Ginza,

00:49:23.740 --> 00:49:25.500
to sell them.

00:49:25.910 --> 00:49:28.580
Lieutenant ... Is everything so bad?

00:49:29.330 --> 00:49:31.630
Don't make that kind of face.

00:49:31.920 --> 00:49:35.800
Such is the fate of fugitive aristocrats.

00:49:36.220 --> 00:49:38.590
While we fled from Siberia to Manchuria,

00:49:39.160 --> 00:49:42.500
That was how we lived.

00:49:43.100 --> 00:49:44.560
Lieutenant.

00:49:48.390 --> 00:49:49.850
Benio-san.

00:49:50.400 --> 00:49:54.610
We are on different paths now.

00:49:54.610 --> 00:49:57.820
I am no longer worthy of you.

00:49:59.450 --> 00:50:01.780
Whatever the circumstances ..

00:50:01.780 --> 00:50:04.080
I've done something unforgivable towards you.

00:50:05.240 --> 00:50:06.830
So that's why ..

00:50:07.750 --> 00:50:10.420
Please forget about me.

00:50:10.420 --> 00:50:11.990
Lieutenant.

00:50:13.500 --> 00:50:15.460
This is wrong.

00:50:16.020 --> 00:50:17.720
I still...

00:50:18.120 --> 00:50:20.120
love her so much.

00:50:21.000 --> 00:50:22.850
I want to take her hand.

00:50:23.100 --> 00:50:25.100
Throw everything away.

00:50:26.470 --> 00:50:28.100
Lieutenant.

00:50:28.100 --> 00:50:30.600
Even if it's time to break up.

00:50:30.600 --> 00:50:33.110
I still love you!

00:50:33.550 --> 00:50:35.110
I want to take his hand.

00:50:35.650 --> 00:50:38.140
Just like that time, and not let go.

00:50:38.140 --> 00:50:40.450
and run far away.

00:50:41.110 --> 00:50:43.120
It was like a dream.

00:50:43.120 --> 00:50:46.290
If only we can return to those unforgettable days.

00:50:48.200 --> 00:50:50.210
But we can't do that.

00:50:59.130 --> 00:51:00.220
Lieutenant.

00:51:00.220 --> 00:51:03.140
While you were my fiancee,

00:51:03.140 --> 00:51:06.430
you did that kind of thing,
and I cannot forgive you.

00:51:08.270 --> 00:51:12.400
So that's why I will never see you again.

00:51:14.730 --> 00:51:16.860
I'm breaking our engagement.

00:51:16.860 --> 00:51:19.440
I will leave Ijuin mansion.

00:51:19.990 --> 00:51:26.620
So please go back as soon as possible
to your grandfather and grandmother.

00:51:26.620 --> 00:51:28.330
Benio-san ..

00:51:28.740 --> 00:51:30.830
That's all I wanted to tell you.

00:51:30.830 --> 00:51:33.170
So please excuse me.

00:51:35.170 --> 00:51:36.670
Benio-san.

00:51:38.340 --> 00:51:43.180
I pray that one day
you'll find your happiness.

00:51:47.890 --> 00:51:49.180
Thank you.

00:51:49.180 --> 00:51:52.480
Please don't worry about me.

00:51:52.480 --> 00:51:53.810
Farewell.

00:51:53.810 --> 00:51:55.900
Lieutenant Ijuin.

00:52:26.680 --> 00:52:28.550
It'll be fine.

00:52:29.800 --> 00:52:31.220
Farewell,

00:52:31.300 --> 00:52:32.520
Lieutenant.

00:52:51.240 --> 00:52:53.250
What is the meaning of this ?!

00:52:53.250 --> 00:52:55.250
Shinobu is alive ?!

00:52:55.250 --> 00:52:57.750
And should I keep it a secret..

00:52:57.750 --> 00:53:00.030
..about his ingratitude and say nothing?

00:53:00.030 --> 00:53:03.260
I will never accept such a daughter-in-law!

00:53:03.260 --> 00:53:05.160
Really ..

00:53:05.160 --> 00:53:10.100
Since Shinobu-san went to the front line, Benio has been taking care of this house year after year.

00:53:10.100 --> 00:53:12.430
What would we do without Benio-san!

00:53:17.660 --> 00:53:18.980
Farewell.

00:53:20.700 --> 00:53:23.840
Farewell,  Ijuin mansion.

00:53:27.660 --> 00:53:30.120
It's unusual for you to honor me with your visit.

00:53:30.450 --> 00:53:34.500
If you talk again about Father’s bank,
I'm gonna have to refuse.

00:53:34.500 --> 00:53:36.500
You're breaking my heart.

00:53:36.500 --> 00:53:40.750
Actually I came to talk about the new house.

00:53:40.330 --> 00:53:53.760
ATTENTION! COCKROACHES
APPEARED AGAIN.

00:53:40.330 --> 00:53:53.760
CAUTION!
FIRE

00:53:40.750 --> 00:53:42.380
New house?

00:53:42.380 --> 00:53:43.630
Are you building a new one?

00:53:43.630 --> 00:53:45.300
That's not it.

00:53:45.300 --> 00:53:48.840
There's a house that't been mortgaged to your father's bank.

00:53:48.840 --> 00:53:50.850
Ancestral home.

00:53:50.850 --> 00:53:54.060
You decided to get out, cockroach Juliet ?!

00:53:55.120 --> 00:53:59.940
So I asked your father to give it to me.

00:54:00.260 --> 00:54:03.730
You want to stay there and fool around again?

00:54:03.900 --> 00:54:05.650
You're such a bad person.

00:54:05.820 --> 00:54:07.260
Ah..

00:54:07.360 --> 00:54:10.910
I'm not such a young woman anymore.

00:54:11.320 --> 00:54:14.700
I want you to come back home.

00:54:14.700 --> 00:54:18.710
If I come home to an empty house, I'll be lonely.

00:54:19.830 --> 00:54:21.130
Mother.

00:54:21.130 --> 00:54:25.340
Save these speeches for some young man.

00:54:25.550 --> 00:54:27.210
Ijuin-sama. Registration of property ownership rights.

00:54:27.340 --> 00:54:28.260
Parasite!

00:54:28.260 --> 00:54:30.220
Buzzing around me!

00:54:30.220 --> 00:54:33.660
Give up or I’ll slam you!

00:54:33.800 --> 00:54:35.350
This is...

00:54:35.350 --> 00:54:36.520
Ijuin?

00:54:37.000 --> 00:54:39.100
The Lieutenant's house mortgage contract?

00:54:39.340 --> 00:54:41.100
That house..

00:54:41.100 --> 00:54:42.480
Tosei-san!

00:54:42.480 --> 00:54:44.150
What's the matter?

00:54:44.150 --> 00:54:45.360
Mother!

00:54:45.360 --> 00:54:48.990
Could you give up on this house?

00:54:48.990 --> 00:54:51.360
No, I don't want to.

00:54:51.360 --> 00:54:53.100
I like it.

00:54:53.100 --> 00:54:56.450
It's such a great mansion.

00:54:56.450 --> 00:54:58.790
But it's strange.

00:54:58.790 --> 00:55:02.630
Why are you so preoccupied with this house?

00:55:05.280 --> 00:55:07.710
Alright. it's gone.

00:55:07.710 --> 00:55:10.470
I don't see it .. I don't see it ..

00:55:10.470 --> 00:55:13.180
It doesn't matter.

00:55:13.180 --> 00:55:15.640
What should I do to make you give it up?

00:55:15.640 --> 00:55:17.970
Hmm.

00:55:20.480 --> 00:55:21.850
Well ..

00:55:21.850 --> 00:55:23.400
Okay.

00:55:23.400 --> 00:55:28.820
If you return home and take over your father’s bank.

00:55:30.610 --> 00:55:31.820
What do you say?

00:55:31.820 --> 00:55:33.470
It's impossible, isn't it?

00:55:33.880 --> 00:55:36.620
Then there’s nothing more to talk about.

00:55:36.620 --> 00:55:37.740
Please wait!

00:55:37.740 --> 00:55:38.940
Mother!

00:55:42.370 --> 00:55:44.120
I get it.

00:55:44.280 --> 00:55:45.960
I'll return home.

00:55:46.120 --> 00:55:48.170
and continue my father’s business.

00:55:48.170 --> 00:55:49.420
Tosei-san?

00:55:49.420 --> 00:55:51.130
Really?

00:55:53.160 --> 00:55:55.430
I got you, Juliete!

00:55:55.430 --> 00:55:59.890
Well, I have to go. I’ll tell your father the good news.

00:56:02.280 --> 00:56:04.810
Madam, I’ve just made some tea!

00:56:07.230 --> 00:56:09.780
What a disgusting thing!

00:56:09.780 --> 00:56:14.610
Tosei-san, I'm so glad you'll close down this company soon!

00:56:14.610 --> 00:56:15.820
Hanamura?

00:56:15.820 --> 00:56:17.450
You're still here?

00:56:17.450 --> 00:56:19.450
I already told you to go home.

00:56:19.620 --> 00:56:20.950
Tosei-san.

00:56:20.950 --> 00:56:23.460
Take the lady home.

00:56:26.700 --> 00:56:30.460
What?! She said the company is closing?

00:56:31.420 --> 00:56:32.840
Chief!

00:56:32.840 --> 00:56:35.180
What does it mean?

00:56:38.890 --> 00:56:40.600
Oh, goodness.

00:56:41.470 --> 00:56:42.880
Hanamura?

00:56:42.880 --> 00:56:44.020
You..

00:56:44.020 --> 00:56:45.480
Chief!

00:56:45.480 --> 00:56:48.840
Is this the mortgage contract on Ijuin mansion?

00:56:49.480 --> 00:56:51.480
Yes, it is.

00:56:51.480 --> 00:56:54.240
Why is it here?

00:56:55.860 --> 00:57:00.410
Their house was mortgaged to my father’s bank.

00:57:00.410 --> 00:57:02.950
My mother said she wanted it for herself.

00:57:02.950 --> 00:57:05.210
And I confiscated it.

00:57:05.210 --> 00:57:06.920
That's all.

00:57:06.920 --> 00:57:09.030
So that’s why you're closing down the company.

00:57:09.100 --> 00:57:11.170
Is it because of this?

00:57:12.170 --> 00:57:14.130
That couldn't be it, right?

00:57:14.130 --> 00:57:15.300
You can't.

00:57:15.300 --> 00:57:20.180
You put all your effort into the work here.

00:57:20.180 --> 00:57:23.270
We all know this.

00:57:23.850 --> 00:57:26.690
I'm sorry. It's already decided.

00:57:27.230 --> 00:57:28.900
Chief.

00:57:29.160 --> 00:57:32.320
Are you doing this for my sake?

00:57:33.720 --> 00:57:34.940
You're wrong.

00:57:35.120 --> 00:57:38.410
You think to much about yourself.

00:57:38.560 --> 00:57:39.910
Go home now.

00:57:39.910 --> 00:57:42.160
I won't allow overtime today.

00:57:52.260 --> 00:57:53.880
Chief.

00:57:54.300 --> 00:57:56.920
Chief will close down the company?

00:57:56.920 --> 00:57:59.300
What's with you? Watch out.

00:57:59.300 --> 00:58:00.550
I'm sorry.

00:58:01.840 --> 00:58:07.230
The Chief always understands when I need help,
and comes to my rescue at any time of the day or night.

00:58:07.400 --> 00:58:10.230
It makes me feel safe.

00:58:15.570 --> 00:58:17.240
And yet ..

00:58:17.420 --> 00:58:19.320
For my sake ..

00:58:19.320 --> 00:58:22.870
he sacrificed his work,
which means so much to him?

00:58:27.580 --> 00:58:29.160
I like you.

00:58:29.160 --> 00:58:30.710
I love you.

00:58:30.710 --> 00:58:31.960
I think ..

00:58:31.960 --> 00:58:36.670
If someday, when his shadow disappears from your heart ..

00:58:37.000 --> 00:58:39.590
just remember me.

00:58:43.600 --> 00:58:45.390
Chief.

00:58:48.230 --> 00:58:52.350
Can I really live without this?

00:58:53.880 --> 00:58:58.280
I wanted to leave my parents as soon as possible and as a result I founded this publishing company.

00:58:58.280 --> 00:59:00.070
So this is all it comes to?

00:59:02.120 --> 00:59:03.620
What do you want?

00:59:03.620 --> 00:59:05.620
You came back here again?

00:59:06.000 --> 00:59:07.620
Chief.

00:59:07.620 --> 00:59:09.960
You see.. I ..

00:59:13.420 --> 00:59:15.170
I have a favor to ask you.

00:59:16.210 --> 00:59:17.630
I ..

00:59:17.630 --> 00:59:18.880
I ..

00:59:18.880 --> 00:59:21.630
Please marry me!

00:59:26.970 --> 00:59:28.850
What a bad joke.

00:59:29.220 --> 00:59:31.210
I'm not joking.

00:59:31.390 --> 00:59:32.690
I ..

00:59:32.690 --> 00:59:33.980
I ..

00:59:34.350 --> 00:59:36.340
I love you, Chief!

00:59:36.440 --> 00:59:38.890
After all, you..

00:59:38.890 --> 00:59:43.160
You really are a kind person.

00:59:44.620 --> 00:59:48.490
And if you become a banker,
even though you feel sick of this thought alone,

00:59:48.490 --> 00:59:50.750
I'll be with you!

00:59:51.210 --> 00:59:53.250
During your difficult times ..

00:59:53.480 --> 00:59:55.210
I want to be by your side.

00:59:56.630 --> 01:00:00.380
So please, take me with you!

01:00:00.380 --> 01:00:02.880
Let's be together always.

01:00:03.500 --> 01:00:05.080
Hanamura.

01:00:05.080 --> 01:00:06.470
Are you serious?

01:00:06.470 --> 01:00:07.680
I'm serious.

01:00:08.300 --> 01:00:09.470
You..

01:00:09.720 --> 01:00:12.480
Do you even understand what you're saying now?

01:00:12.480 --> 01:00:16.610
These are very serious things!
Did you think it over properly ?!

01:00:16.610 --> 01:00:19.190
Don't act on momentary feelings!

01:00:19.190 --> 01:00:21.690
But the main thing is Ijuin.

01:00:21.690 --> 01:00:24.490
You still can't forget him.

01:00:25.410 --> 01:00:26.870
Lieutenant.

01:00:28.330 --> 01:00:31.900
No, It's already over between us.

01:00:32.080 --> 01:00:33.710
I've already forgotten him!

01:00:33.710 --> 01:00:35.710
It's better this way.

01:00:36.710 --> 01:00:41.510
No matter how you look at it,
my love only hurts him!

01:00:41.510 --> 01:00:44.800
I will bury him deep in my heart.

01:00:46.380 --> 01:00:49.430
Chief. If I'm with you ..

01:00:49.430 --> 01:00:51.720
I can definitely forget him.

01:00:55.440 --> 01:00:57.190
Starting today ..

01:00:57.190 --> 01:01:00.970
I will see only you.

01:01:08.870 --> 01:01:10.490
Madam.

01:01:10.490 --> 01:01:13.160
I don’t know how it came about,

01:01:13.160 --> 01:01:17.500
but the young lady found herself a new bridegroom!

01:01:17.500 --> 01:01:20.840
Furthermore, he's such a noble gentleman!

01:01:20.840 --> 01:01:22.300
Ki-i-ya!

01:01:25.970 --> 01:01:28.780
It’s hard to chop off a motionless target!

01:01:28.780 --> 01:01:31.660
Our young lady is incorrigible!

01:01:31.970 --> 01:01:34.640
I even made tea!

01:01:38.560 --> 01:01:39.770
Madam.

01:01:39.770 --> 01:01:42.770
I have a bad feeling about this.

01:01:46.860 --> 01:01:48.740
I'm so relieved.

01:01:48.740 --> 01:01:50.890
He turns out to be a great guy.

01:01:52.280 --> 01:01:57.250
At any rate, the family promise is again postponed for another generation.

01:01:57.250 --> 01:02:00.380
I'm sorry, Father.

01:01:59.020 --> 01:02:06.380
The Twelfth Year of Taisho (1923)

01:02:00.380 --> 01:02:03.070
We've already discussed it with Aoe-kun.

01:02:03.070 --> 01:02:06.590
and decided that your wedding will be on 1st September.

01:02:07.130 --> 01:02:09.470
There's only 2 months left.

01:02:09.470 --> 01:02:11.800
We have to hurry.

01:02:12.930 --> 01:02:15.350
It’s painful to watch.

01:02:15.350 --> 01:02:18.440
Ijuins used to have such a beautiful garden.

01:02:18.440 --> 01:02:20.420
And now everything's wilted.

01:02:22.900 --> 01:02:25.110
Wait a minute! Who are you?

01:02:25.110 --> 01:02:26.990
What are you doing here?

01:02:26.990 --> 01:02:29.820
Clothes! Hurry up and put some clothes on!

01:02:30.110 --> 01:02:32.620
Excuse me.

01:02:32.620 --> 01:02:34.850
And you are ..

01:02:34.850 --> 01:02:37.830
I'm Kitakoji Tamaki.

01:02:37.830 --> 01:02:42.210
I have known the Ijuins since childhood!

01:02:42.210 --> 01:02:44.420
Ah, so it's you!

01:02:44.750 --> 01:02:47.760
I'm the new butler here.

01:02:47.980 --> 01:02:49.840
My name is Onijima.

01:02:49.840 --> 01:02:51.430
Wait a minute.

01:02:52.260 --> 01:02:54.890
You've come  for the roses, right?

01:02:54.890 --> 01:02:57.850
The Mistress ordered me to help you collect the bouquet.

01:02:58.180 --> 01:02:59.430
Take it.

01:02:59.430 --> 01:03:01.850
Who treats flowers like this!

01:03:01.850 --> 01:03:03.860
You're a hooligan, not a butler!

01:03:05.110 --> 01:03:07.860
Sorry. Did the thorns pricked you?

01:03:14.490 --> 01:03:16.280
Insolent fellow!

01:03:17.870 --> 01:03:22.330
You suddenly hit a guy on the face. What a modern woman you are.

01:03:22.540 --> 01:03:25.380
It's because you've done something bad.

01:03:25.380 --> 01:03:27.550
I'm sorry for that.

01:03:28.180 --> 01:03:32.130
Did you really serve under Shinobu-san in Siberia?

01:03:32.130 --> 01:03:36.810
Yes. I was wounded and the Lieutenant did that.

01:03:38.480 --> 01:03:40.770
The thing with Lieutenant and Benio-san.

01:03:40.770 --> 01:03:43.480
It happened because of me.

01:03:43.480 --> 01:03:48.940
Onijima-san. I also think the thing that happened to those two was unfortunate.

01:03:48.940 --> 01:03:52.570
But what happened cannot be changed.

01:03:53.360 --> 01:03:55.910
Anyway, both Shinobu-san and Benio ..

01:03:55.910 --> 01:03:59.620
has decided to start a new life,
and each went their own way.

01:03:59.620 --> 01:04:01.250
I ..

01:04:01.250 --> 01:04:06.820
believe that even in the most difficult circumstances, a person is able to start all over again if one can dream.

01:04:09.170 --> 01:04:12.300
Then, what is your dream?

01:04:12.300 --> 01:04:14.340
My dream is..

01:04:14.340 --> 01:04:18.680
is just to find a man whom I can love
with all my heart and marry him.

01:04:18.680 --> 01:04:21.930
You want to find yourself a husband?

01:04:22.180 --> 01:04:24.980
So you're also a modern woman.

01:04:24.980 --> 01:04:27.110
If it's you,you certainly  can do it.

01:04:27.110 --> 01:04:28.770
Good luck.

01:04:28.770 --> 01:04:30.720
Thank you!

01:04:31.400 --> 01:04:32.530
It's unfortunate.

01:04:32.530 --> 01:04:36.700
It’s regretable that I can’t approach you, Princess.

01:04:37.950 --> 01:04:39.370
Bye.

01:04:46.370 --> 01:04:48.540
So, you'll marry the editor..

01:04:48.540 --> 01:04:50.880
.. to not make the Lieutenant worry?

01:04:50.880 --> 01:04:52.990
Ranmaru, are you angry?

01:04:52.990 --> 01:04:54.590
The Benio-san I know ..

01:04:54.590 --> 01:04:58.350
once she falls in love with someone, she won't easily give up.

01:04:58.680 --> 01:05:00.720
It's not like that at all.

01:05:00.720 --> 01:05:02.670
I love the Chief editor.

01:05:02.670 --> 01:05:07.340
After all, for the sake of myself and the Lieutenant,

01:05:07.340 --> 01:05:10.270
sacrificed the work that's important to him.

01:05:10.940 --> 01:05:13.740
No one excepts him is capable of such love!

01:05:14.860 --> 01:05:16.700
So, I ..

01:05:16.700 --> 01:05:19.200
love the Chief.

01:05:20.240 --> 01:05:21.990
You're lying!

01:05:21.990 --> 01:05:24.110
Benio-san, you're making a mistake!

01:05:26.290 --> 01:05:27.490
Ranmaru.

01:05:27.490 --> 01:05:31.420
I'm sorry. I'm glad you worry so much for me.

01:05:31.640 --> 01:05:34.630
But I'm really happy.

01:05:34.630 --> 01:05:39.470
Come now. Let's go cut the bamboo branches
and decorate the house for Tanabata!

01:05:41.760 --> 01:05:43.430
Tamaki, you're getting married ?!

01:05:43.430 --> 01:05:46.160
My family decided everything for me.

01:05:46.160 --> 01:05:48.350
Well? What kind of person is he?

01:05:48.350 --> 01:05:49.880
You know what ...

01:05:49.880 --> 01:05:53.780
Nothing good and nothing bad, that kind of guy.

01:05:53.780 --> 01:05:56.860
I can hardly fall in love with him.

01:05:57.220 --> 01:06:00.140
I need a man who is more ...

01:06:00.200 --> 01:06:02.350
more...

01:06:03.240 --> 01:06:06.540
No! Who is he anyway?!

01:06:06.780 --> 01:06:08.320
Tamaki?

01:06:14.300 --> 01:06:17.460
At the dawn of time, a woman was truly the sun!

01:06:19.510 --> 01:06:21.910
Those days were fun.

01:06:21.910 --> 01:06:25.390
We lived in hopes and carried away
on the wings of a dream beyond the horizon!

01:06:25.740 --> 01:06:28.100
We were free as birds.

01:06:30.060 --> 01:06:35.400
Perhaps this is the law of nature that sooner or later you have to descend from heaven.

01:06:36.320 --> 01:06:37.830
Lonely, isn't it?

01:06:37.830 --> 01:06:40.100
Don't you think so?

01:06:41.000 --> 01:06:44.780
But birds sometimes sit on a tree just to rest.

01:06:45.450 --> 01:06:47.360
That's right.

01:06:48.370 --> 01:06:55.090
Virgo - Life is so short

01:06:55.090 --> 01:07:03.180
Loving in haste

01:07:03.180 --> 01:07:10.390
Wilted flower lips

01:07:10.390 --> 01:07:17.650
don't stop.

01:07:17.650 --> 01:07:24.700
Moments and heat of passion in our blood.

01:07:24.700 --> 01:07:31.960
Turns into ice.

01:07:31.960 --> 01:07:39.170
Live today

01:07:39.170 --> 01:07:46.140
tomorrow will come.

01:08:09.000 --> 01:08:11.620
The sun is kind of strange today...

01:08:13.290 --> 01:08:14.620
What's with you?!

01:08:14.620 --> 01:08:16.500
Don't scare me like that!

01:08:17.170 --> 01:08:21.970
The landlord and the mistress told me to collect a bouquet for the bride.

01:08:21.970 --> 01:08:23.840
Thank you for the bouquet.

01:08:23.840 --> 01:08:27.100
Please send my regards to them.

01:08:28.180 --> 01:08:30.180
It's morning already?

01:08:30.640 --> 01:08:33.380
Shinobu-san has already moved in to the mansion?

01:08:33.380 --> 01:08:34.300
Yes.

01:08:34.300 --> 01:08:37.220
He recently returned home with Larisa-san.

01:08:37.220 --> 01:08:40.780
Did Shinobu-san know about the wedding?

01:08:40.780 --> 01:08:41.750
No.

01:08:41.900 --> 01:08:45.570
I can't figure out how to tell him.

01:08:46.320 --> 01:08:49.370
If by any chance, Shinobu-san find out about it ..

01:08:49.370 --> 01:08:52.660
.. please tell him that I’ll get married in the fall too.

01:08:53.540 --> 01:08:56.570
Are you getting married?

01:08:56.750 --> 01:08:59.250
With whom?

01:08:59.460 --> 01:09:02.920
I've decided to follow the advice of my dear family.

01:09:03.720 --> 01:09:09.350
My fiancé is from a good family,
and I also really liked his family.

01:09:09.720 --> 01:09:14.230
Eh! You said that you're going to find the person you love yourself.

01:09:14.230 --> 01:09:17.730
With that attitude, yet you fall for a guy with a good family?

01:09:17.730 --> 01:09:20.110
Ha! Look who's talking!

01:09:20.110 --> 01:09:23.440
At least he's not such a savage like you!

01:09:27.360 --> 01:09:28.620
Are you serious?

01:09:29.950 --> 01:09:32.540
Of course! Otherwise, I wouldn't be engaged to him!

01:09:32.540 --> 01:09:34.700
Well, get married if you yourself decide so.

01:09:34.700 --> 01:09:36.830
With whomever. Whatever.

01:09:42.840 --> 01:09:44.280
There are no thorns.

01:09:44.420 --> 01:09:47.440
Did Onijima-san cut them off?

01:09:49.390 --> 01:09:52.640
I've always say the opposite of what I really feel.

01:09:53.180 --> 01:09:54.640
If only I could ...

01:09:56.560 --> 01:09:58.760
Tenmaru, Chimaru.

01:09:59.050 --> 01:09:59.920
What's wrong?

01:09:59.920 --> 01:10:01.770
Calm down.

01:10:01.770 --> 01:10:04.440
Recently, a rumble was heard ... Like a typhoon.

01:10:04.440 --> 01:10:05.940
What a strange night.

01:10:06.190 --> 01:10:07.990
I have a bad feeling.

01:10:08.320 --> 01:10:09.950
Since we're talking about strangeness,

01:10:10.110 --> 01:10:12.450
You're strange today, Onijima.

01:10:12.830 --> 01:10:14.870
You seem to be avoiding me.

01:10:14.870 --> 01:10:16.660
Grandma and Grandpa too.

01:10:16.660 --> 01:10:19.580
Everyone shies away from me like a plague.

01:10:20.880 --> 01:10:22.290
Did something happen?

01:10:24.500 --> 01:10:26.920
Benio-san's wedding ..

01:10:26.920 --> 01:10:28.300
.. is tomorrow.

01:10:29.840 --> 01:10:31.000
Tomorrow?

01:10:38.880 --> 01:10:40.590
So that's it.

01:10:40.590 --> 01:10:42.170
Now I understand.

01:10:43.110 --> 01:10:47.850
Recently, we received an anonymous letter with a document of ownership of this house.

01:10:47.850 --> 01:10:52.270
Наш особняк был заложен в банке Аоэ.
This house was mortgaged to Aoe Bank.

01:10:52.820 --> 01:10:54.870
So that's how it happened.

01:10:55.580 --> 01:10:56.870
Aoe?!

01:10:57.950 --> 01:10:59.960
Lieutenant, just give me the order.

01:11:00.290 --> 01:11:02.420
I'll break up that wedding right away!

01:11:02.880 --> 01:11:03.880
Onijima.

01:11:04.290 --> 01:11:09.300
You yourself know that the one Benio-san really thinks about is you!

01:11:10.130 --> 01:11:12.180
And you also..

01:11:13.390 --> 01:11:15.930
Don't say another word, Onijima.

01:11:16.640 --> 01:11:17.560
Enough.

01:11:17.970 --> 01:11:19.390
This is our fate.

01:11:20.730 --> 01:11:25.860
To protect her on the path of life, to protect the cloudless sky above her head ..

01:11:25.860 --> 01:11:27.720
is not me anymore.

01:11:29.190 --> 01:11:30.860
It's painful.

01:11:30.860 --> 01:11:32.860
It hurts my heart.

01:11:33.700 --> 01:11:35.160
Sir!

01:11:35.870 --> 01:11:36.990
Larisa-sama is ..

01:11:36.990 --> 01:11:38.450
Blood! She spits blood!

01:11:40.790 --> 01:11:41.710
Larisa!

01:11:47.860 --> 01:11:51.780
m 1515 624 l 1770 624 1770 741 1515 741

01:11:47.860 --> 01:11:51.780
BEST
WISHES
ON YOUR WEDDING!

01:11:47.860 --> 01:11:51.780
THE TWELFTH YEAR OF TAISO (1923), SEPTEMBER 1, MORNING

01:11:51.840 --> 01:11:54.510
Today is definitely a great day for a wedding!

01:11:54.510 --> 01:11:57.220
Boss, congratulations on your wedding.

01:11:58.600 --> 01:12:00.480
Stand back, people!

01:12:00.480 --> 01:12:02.980
Benio the boss is getting married.

01:12:04.150 --> 01:12:05.810
I forgot about this.

01:12:11.820 --> 01:12:13.450
Enough already.

01:12:13.990 --> 01:12:16.410
I swore to forget everything.

01:12:17.660 --> 01:12:19.740
All that was carefully kept in memory.

01:12:20.160 --> 01:12:22.750
I buried deep in my heart.

01:12:24.120 --> 01:12:30.120
Even if, because of this, it hurts my heart.

01:12:31.130 --> 01:12:33.130
Even if I'm completely at loss now ..

01:12:33.130 --> 01:12:38.430
life goes on and inevitably all memories will be washed away.

01:12:47.060 --> 01:12:48.980
This is also fate.

01:12:49.230 --> 01:12:52.610
Does love always depends on luck?

01:12:52.610 --> 01:12:54.200
Chief!

01:13:03.120 --> 01:13:05.940
You're here, my love.

01:13:06.200 --> 01:13:07.290
Yes.

01:13:07.920 --> 01:13:09.500
You look beautiful.

01:13:09.500 --> 01:13:11.250
You just don't realise it.

01:13:11.250 --> 01:13:14.300
You look dashing as always.

01:13:15.260 --> 01:13:16.620
I love you.

01:13:17.220 --> 01:13:18.710
I love you too.

01:13:21.720 --> 01:13:25.210
From today on, I will be living with this man!

01:13:29.150 --> 01:13:31.360
Sasha.

01:13:32.940 --> 01:13:34.400
Sasha.

01:13:34.400 --> 01:13:35.770
My dear.

01:13:35.770 --> 01:13:37.950
Larisa, you've waken up?

01:13:38.410 --> 01:13:40.200
I'm here.

01:13:40.200 --> 01:13:41.450
Don't worry.

01:13:43.120 --> 01:13:44.190
No.

01:13:44.250 --> 01:13:46.790
You're not Sasha.

01:13:47.250 --> 01:13:48.460
You're Shinobu-san.

01:13:48.460 --> 01:13:50.540
Larisa, what are you talking about?

01:13:50.540 --> 01:13:53.070
Thank you, Shinobu-san.

01:13:53.500 --> 01:13:58.300
Although you've regained your memory, you continue to pretend to be Sasha.

01:13:58.970 --> 01:14:01.180
You're such a kind person.

01:14:02.040 --> 01:14:03.330
Larisa ..

01:14:03.430 --> 01:14:09.230
I've clung to that kindness of yours.

01:14:10.230 --> 01:14:12.340
Forgive me, please.

01:14:12.360 --> 01:14:15.530
I deceived you.

01:14:16.320 --> 01:14:22.230
The truth is, your heart belongs to that girl!

01:14:22.830 --> 01:14:27.120
It's my fault that you two broke up.

01:14:29.750 --> 01:14:31.950
Enough about it.

01:14:31.960 --> 01:14:33.960
If you didn't save me,

01:14:33.960 --> 01:14:36.990
I wouldn't be here now.

01:14:37.470 --> 01:14:40.890
I don't regret the path I've chosen.

01:14:41.510 --> 01:14:44.350
No. That's a lie.

01:14:44.600 --> 01:14:48.270
You're lying to yourself.

01:14:50.100 --> 01:14:56.050
And I ensnare you into this web of lies.

01:14:56.190 --> 01:14:57.320
Larisa.

01:14:57.320 --> 01:14:59.320
Listen to me, Shinobu-san.

01:14:59.320 --> 01:15:06.230
If a person pledged his life to love, when that love dies,

01:15:06.230 --> 01:15:08.830
the person will die too.

01:15:09.370 --> 01:15:14.710
No matter how I live, inside me is empty just like a shell.

01:15:14.710 --> 01:15:16.590
Shinobu-san.

01:15:17.020 --> 01:15:19.470
I love you.

01:15:20.170 --> 01:15:24.390
Whoever I am, you've always treated me with love,

01:15:24.390 --> 01:15:27.250
and I don’t know how to thank you for that.

01:15:27.250 --> 01:15:28.310
Larisa.

01:15:28.720 --> 01:15:33.810
That's why I don't want such a life for you.

01:15:33.810 --> 01:15:36.360
Larisa, be quiet now.

01:15:36.400 --> 01:15:37.530
No.

01:15:37.530 --> 01:15:38.890
Shinobu-san.

01:15:39.110 --> 01:15:40.150
Please ..

01:15:40.150 --> 01:15:45.870
If you think that I've brought you back to life,

01:15:46.950 --> 01:15:52.500
then return to your life and your loved one.

01:15:53.750 --> 01:15:57.250
And don't ever let it go.

01:15:57.880 --> 01:15:58.840
Larisa!

01:15:58.840 --> 01:16:02.180
Please stop feeling sorry for me.

01:16:03.180 --> 01:16:04.590
I have ..

01:16:04.590 --> 01:16:06.600
Sasha.

01:16:07.470 --> 01:16:11.350
Right now ... Among the wildflowers ...

01:16:11.350 --> 01:16:14.230
In a lush wild meadow ...

01:16:14.230 --> 01:16:17.720
Sasha's waiting for me.

01:16:18.820 --> 01:16:21.220
Sasha ..

01:16:21.320 --> 01:16:22.610
Now ..

01:16:27.580 --> 01:16:29.020
Larisa.

01:16:39.590 --> 01:16:41.620
I'll go get the doctor.

01:16:43.930 --> 01:16:45.550
Aoe Tosei

01:16:45.550 --> 01:16:54.190
Do you take Hanamura Benio as your wife and swear to be with her in sickness and in health until death do you part?

01:16:54.190 --> 01:16:55.140
Yes.

01:16:55.810 --> 01:16:57.400
Hanamura Benio

01:16:57.810 --> 01:17:05.820
Do you take Aoe Tosei as your husband and swear to be with him in sickness and in health until death do you part?

01:17:05.820 --> 01:17:06.910
Yes.

01:17:07.620 --> 01:17:10.400
You may exchange the rings.

01:17:39.400 --> 01:17:40.860
Earthquake?

01:17:41.540 --> 01:17:46.130
Taisho's twelfth year (1923), September 1, 11:58 a.m.

01:17:41.540 --> 01:17:46.130
The Great Kanto Earthquake began.

01:17:57.670 --> 01:17:59.000
Is everyone alright?

01:17:59.330 --> 01:18:00.710
It looks like everyone's alright.

01:18:00.710 --> 01:18:02.450
The church is ..

01:18:06.900 --> 01:18:08.680
It's on fire!

01:18:10.260 --> 01:18:12.560
Chief, Ranmaru is not here.

01:18:12.560 --> 01:18:13.540
What?!

01:18:13.600 --> 01:18:14.890
Forgive me, Boss.

01:18:14.890 --> 01:18:17.100
I did not watch over him!

01:18:17.100 --> 01:18:18.190
Is he still inside?

01:18:18.640 --> 01:18:19.690
Ranmaru!

01:18:19.690 --> 01:18:20.860
Hanamura!

01:18:24.190 --> 01:18:26.400
Lieutenant! Are you alright?

01:18:27.490 --> 01:18:30.240
Onijima, is Grandpa and Grandma okay?

01:18:30.240 --> 01:18:32.990
We're fine! What about Larisa?

01:18:33.280 --> 01:18:36.900
She died, just before the earthquake.

01:18:37.290 --> 01:18:38.460
I see.

01:18:38.460 --> 01:18:40.880
May she rest in peace.

01:18:42.790 --> 01:18:43.920
Another quake!

01:18:44.380 --> 01:18:47.120
The earthquake seems to be very strong!

01:18:47.760 --> 01:18:48.550
Benio-san.

01:18:49.470 --> 01:18:51.890
I was told that the ceremony will be held in the church.

01:18:52.970 --> 01:18:54.560
Will they be alright?

01:18:56.850 --> 01:19:01.900
If a person pledged his life to love, when that love dies,

01:19:01.900 --> 01:19:04.470
the person will die too.

01:19:05.150 --> 01:19:07.530
Return to your loved one!

01:19:11.240 --> 01:19:12.600
Larisa.

01:19:13.900 --> 01:19:15.200
I have to go.

01:19:15.200 --> 01:19:18.250
I have to make sure that Benio-san is alive and well!

01:19:18.250 --> 01:19:20.920
That's right, Shinobu! Go to Benio!

01:19:20.920 --> 01:19:22.210
Onijima, prepare the horse!

01:19:22.210 --> 01:19:23.330
I understand.

01:19:23.330 --> 01:19:25.130
Lieutenant, put on your uniform!

01:19:25.130 --> 01:19:27.950
In the midst of chaos, form is the most important!

01:19:33.390 --> 01:19:36.600
Benio-san, please be alright!

01:19:38.860 --> 01:19:41.350
Ranmaru, where are you?

01:19:41.350 --> 01:19:43.170
Ranmaru-kun, where are you?

01:19:43.170 --> 01:19:45.610
Ranmaru, answer me!

01:19:46.150 --> 01:19:48.940
Hey! I'm here!

01:19:48.940 --> 01:19:50.320
Help me!

01:19:51.860 --> 01:19:54.700
My leg hurts .. I'm stuck.

01:19:54.700 --> 01:19:56.620
It'll be alright. Now let's get it out.

01:20:00.500 --> 01:20:02.210
Ranmaru, can you walk?

01:20:03.920 --> 01:20:06.460
Hold on to me! We can’t stay here anymore.

01:20:06.460 --> 01:20:07.130
Hurry!

01:20:08.630 --> 01:20:10.300
The roof is already on fire!

01:20:10.300 --> 01:20:11.420
We're leaving!

01:20:17.180 --> 01:20:18.600
Hurry! Get out!

01:20:18.600 --> 01:20:19.430
Wait!

01:20:19.430 --> 01:20:21.850
It hurts ... I can’t walk!

01:20:23.100 --> 01:20:23.810
It's dangerous!

01:20:27.690 --> 01:20:28.570
Hanamura!

01:20:28.570 --> 01:20:30.940
Benio-san! Come here quickly!

01:20:34.660 --> 01:20:37.200
Hanamura!

01:20:42.370 --> 01:20:43.500
Answer me!

01:20:43.500 --> 01:20:44.750
Benio-san!

01:20:48.700 --> 01:20:50.460
Chief, it's dangerous!

01:20:50.460 --> 01:20:51.960
The church is ...

01:20:52.100 --> 01:20:53.510
Chief!

01:20:54.580 --> 01:20:56.300
Please be safe!

01:20:59.180 --> 01:21:00.390
Hanamura!

01:21:00.390 --> 01:21:02.220
Where are you?!

01:21:07.520 --> 01:21:10.520
What is going on? What happened to Tokyo ?!

01:21:11.320 --> 01:21:12.280
Benio-san.

01:21:12.570 --> 01:21:13.570
Benio-san.

01:21:13.570 --> 01:21:15.150
Please be safe.

01:21:15.400 --> 01:21:17.240
That's all I wish for!

01:21:17.660 --> 01:21:18.780
Benio-san!

01:21:18.780 --> 01:21:19.950
Please live!

01:21:24.620 --> 01:21:26.830
Lieutenant, go on ahead!

01:21:26.830 --> 01:21:29.920
The church is to the right, then straight ahead.

01:21:29.920 --> 01:21:31.170
I get it.

01:21:31.900 --> 01:21:33.450
The church is ..

01:21:33.450 --> 01:21:34.540
this way!

01:21:37.660 --> 01:21:39.170
What's this?

01:21:41.760 --> 01:21:42.930
Okay. Okay.

01:21:42.930 --> 01:21:44.430
It's too difficult for you to get through.

01:21:44.430 --> 01:21:46.600
Be careful on your way home.

01:22:01.490 --> 01:22:02.370
Hanamura.

01:22:04.290 --> 01:22:06.960
If you try to get out from the other side ...

01:22:08.100 --> 01:22:09.170
Hanamura!

01:22:09.170 --> 01:22:11.130
Tosei-san, stop!

01:22:11.130 --> 01:22:12.170
Wait!

01:22:12.170 --> 01:22:15.550
I'm going too. Benio. Benio.

01:22:15.550 --> 01:22:17.840
I'm also going with you!

01:22:17.840 --> 01:22:18.680
Wait!

01:22:18.680 --> 01:22:21.140
Ranmaru, you can't go with that leg.

01:22:21.140 --> 01:22:23.760
Let's go to a safe place.

01:22:24.640 --> 01:22:25.560
Sparks!

01:22:27.640 --> 01:22:29.230
It’s too dangerous to stay here!

01:22:29.230 --> 01:22:31.440
You too, let's take shelter with us!

01:22:31.440 --> 01:22:33.150
How about Tosei?

01:22:33.150 --> 01:22:34.570
How about Benio?

01:22:34.860 --> 01:22:39.430
Don't be afraid! They'll be all right!

01:22:40.200 --> 01:22:42.160
Then, let's go!

01:22:44.290 --> 01:22:46.450
There's smoke all around.

01:22:46.450 --> 01:22:48.160
Where the heck is Aoe-kun?

01:22:48.830 --> 01:22:51.380
Benio! Benio!

01:22:57.130 --> 01:22:59.840
Benio! Benio!

01:23:01.720 --> 01:23:03.720
I can't get through here too.

01:23:04.510 --> 01:23:07.100
What is happening ... What has Tokyo turned into?

01:23:10.600 --> 01:23:11.600
It's the river.

01:23:14.770 --> 01:23:16.900
I'll go up from here and enter through the back door.

01:23:18.780 --> 01:23:20.860
Is Hanamura still alive?

01:23:21.200 --> 01:23:22.910
It’s scary to look at these ruins ...

01:23:23.370 --> 01:23:24.120
No!

01:23:26.200 --> 01:23:29.230
She's not such a person to die here!

01:23:39.670 --> 01:23:41.880
The main character will not die!

01:23:44.350 --> 01:23:45.260
Where am I?

01:23:45.640 --> 01:23:46.760
Where is everyone?

01:23:49.730 --> 01:23:51.100
Chief!

01:23:51.100 --> 01:23:52.650
Where are you?

01:23:56.440 --> 01:23:57.230
It's hot.

01:23:57.780 --> 01:23:59.320
The fire is getting closer.

01:24:02.780 --> 01:24:05.240
Why is it like this?

01:24:06.410 --> 01:24:09.330
If it continues like this, am I going to die?

01:24:11.460 --> 01:24:12.370
Lieutenant.

01:24:13.790 --> 01:24:17.800
I don't want to die, not being able to see Lieutenant ever again.

01:24:18.550 --> 01:24:19.510
No way!

01:24:20.300 --> 01:24:21.840
Even if I'm dying,

01:24:21.840 --> 01:24:25.140
I want to see the lieutenant one last time!

01:24:28.890 --> 01:24:30.220
Lieutenant ..

01:24:30.600 --> 01:24:31.960
Lieutenant!

01:24:34.400 --> 01:24:37.360
It seems that we are very separated from the rest.

01:24:42.530 --> 01:24:45.610
I can't go through here with the wounded man and the woman.

01:24:46.410 --> 01:24:47.990
Hey!

01:24:48.530 --> 01:24:50.240
Hey!

01:24:50.620 --> 01:24:52.120
Onijima-san?

01:24:52.760 --> 01:24:54.290
Are you alright?

01:24:54.620 --> 01:24:56.460
Don’t go back there, everything is also on fire there.

01:24:56.460 --> 01:24:57.840
It's better to break through here.

01:24:58.290 --> 01:25:01.130
Then please help the girl!

01:25:01.460 --> 01:25:02.670
I will carry him.

01:25:04.760 --> 01:25:06.260
Thank you, Ushio-san.

01:25:06.260 --> 01:25:07.720
Then, hurry up!

01:25:09.180 --> 01:25:11.770
Hold on tight!

01:25:11.770 --> 01:25:13.100
We'll be going!

01:25:15.850 --> 01:25:18.360
Now is not the time to stand on ceremony! Come quickly!

01:25:21.980 --> 01:25:25.150
Hold on tight, Princess, otherwise you'll fall down!

01:25:25.150 --> 01:25:25.990
Yes.

01:25:26.780 --> 01:25:30.240
If I'm with this person, I’m ready to go to the ends of the world!

01:25:33.200 --> 01:25:35.580
I can't move anymore.

01:25:37.170 --> 01:25:38.500
Lieutenant.

01:25:38.920 --> 01:25:41.710
I want to see you at least one more time.

01:25:43.020 --> 01:25:45.200
Lieutenant ..

01:25:45.200 --> 01:25:46.130
Lieutenant ..

01:25:49.510 --> 01:25:52.310
No matter where I look, everything's burning.

01:25:54.060 --> 01:25:56.690
Hey! Is there anyone alive?

01:25:57.140 --> 01:25:59.610
Anybody?! Please respond!

01:26:00.230 --> 01:26:01.480
Benio-san!

01:26:01.760 --> 01:26:03.300
Where are you?!

01:26:07.990 --> 01:26:08.660
That's ..

01:26:08.990 --> 01:26:09.990
Benio-san!

01:26:11.910 --> 01:26:13.450
Benio-san! Hold on!

01:26:16.460 --> 01:26:17.410
Benio-san!

01:26:23.090 --> 01:26:27.630
Wow! So I'm already in heaven!

01:26:28.300 --> 01:26:29.740
Then this is an angel?

01:26:29.740 --> 01:26:31.640
He looks a lot like Lieutenant.

01:26:32.890 --> 01:26:35.720
So, everything is true about paradise!
Excellent service here.

01:26:35.720 --> 01:26:37.600
Wow! Everything is so real.

01:26:38.390 --> 01:26:40.480
I'm real, Benio-san.

01:26:42.860 --> 01:26:43.940
Really?

01:26:44.780 --> 01:26:46.320
It's really you, Lieutenant?

01:26:46.940 --> 01:26:48.400
I came to save you.

01:26:48.780 --> 01:26:50.610
Thank god, you're alright.

01:26:50.950 --> 01:26:52.320
I've finally found you.

01:26:53.200 --> 01:26:54.410
Lieutenant.

01:26:54.990 --> 01:26:56.450
Lieutenant!

01:26:56.450 --> 01:26:58.790
Lieutenant !!!

01:27:00.210 --> 01:27:01.880
Benio-san!

01:27:04.880 --> 01:27:05.920
Let's go.

01:27:05.920 --> 01:27:08.840
If we don’t hurry, we won’t be able to get out.

01:27:10.260 --> 01:27:11.300
Benio-san?

01:27:11.800 --> 01:27:14.300
No. I'll be fine on my own.

01:27:14.300 --> 01:27:15.680
I will get out.

01:27:16.180 --> 01:27:18.140
You should return to the mansion.

01:27:18.930 --> 01:27:19.980
Benio-san.

01:27:20.440 --> 01:27:21.810
You're needed there.

01:27:21.810 --> 01:27:23.810
Grandpa and Grandma ..

01:27:24.150 --> 01:27:25.610
And Larisa-san too.

01:27:26.900 --> 01:27:28.610
I'll be fine.

01:27:30.040 --> 01:27:31.110
Larisa is..

01:27:31.820 --> 01:27:33.450
dead.

01:27:34.990 --> 01:27:36.790
Just before the earthquake.

01:27:37.840 --> 01:27:39.620
She died quietly and peacefully.

01:27:40.540 --> 01:27:42.750
Before she died, she said ..

01:27:42.750 --> 01:27:44.750
that I should return to you.

01:27:45.630 --> 01:27:47.920
"I brought you back to life."

01:27:47.920 --> 01:27:50.760
"Return to your loved one."

01:27:51.430 --> 01:27:54.120
She said that?

01:27:55.580 --> 01:27:59.640
If you die here, I will die with you!

01:28:00.180 --> 01:28:03.310
I will never lie to myself again!

01:28:03.310 --> 01:28:06.360
You are the one I chose!

01:28:06.980 --> 01:28:10.400
I will share your fate, whatever it may be!

01:28:11.190 --> 01:28:12.400
Lieutenant!

01:28:14.240 --> 01:28:16.580
I won't ever let you go.

01:28:35.970 --> 01:28:36.850
It's no good.

01:28:37.350 --> 01:28:39.510
This is also a dead end. Everything is engulfed.

01:28:42.960 --> 01:28:44.010
Watch out!

01:28:49.970 --> 01:28:51.140
Lieutenant.

01:28:51.650 --> 01:28:52.690
My leg ..

01:28:53.150 --> 01:28:54.450
I twisted my leg.

01:28:54.610 --> 01:28:55.610
Lieutenant!

01:28:57.530 --> 01:28:58.940
We can't go anywhere.

01:29:00.700 --> 01:29:01.860
Anybody!

01:29:01.860 --> 01:29:03.750
Is anybody there?!

01:29:03.750 --> 01:29:05.100
Help!

01:29:05.100 --> 01:29:06.280
Hey!

01:29:06.790 --> 01:29:07.830
Hey !!!

01:29:08.840 --> 01:29:10.070
We're here!

01:29:10.070 --> 01:29:11.670
Help us, please!

01:29:15.550 --> 01:29:16.430
Chief.

01:29:17.680 --> 01:29:19.640
Here you are, Hanamura.

01:29:20.180 --> 01:29:21.560
Ijuin is here too?

01:29:22.680 --> 01:29:24.180
It looks like you're injured.

01:29:24.940 --> 01:29:26.400
Hanamura, are you alright?

01:29:28.610 --> 01:29:30.940
I'm sorry, Chief.

01:29:31.650 --> 01:29:32.940
Hanamura?

01:29:33.320 --> 01:29:34.360
I'm sorry.

01:29:34.610 --> 01:29:37.780
Chief, even though I swore to love you,

01:29:38.660 --> 01:29:42.830
At the brink of death, as I thought, I wanted to see Lieutenant, not you!

01:29:43.870 --> 01:29:47.960
So, Chief, I have no right to receive your help!

01:29:48.920 --> 01:29:51.800
So do you prefer to die here with him?

01:29:55.040 --> 01:29:56.220
What nonsense!

01:29:56.220 --> 01:29:57.510
Pull yourself together.

01:29:57.930 --> 01:29:59.930
Did the earthquake affect your mind?

01:30:00.970 --> 01:30:02.320
The Hanamura I know ..

01:30:02.320 --> 01:30:05.520
.. would never whine and want to simply die.

01:30:07.890 --> 01:30:09.310
Let's go, Benio-san.

01:30:09.810 --> 01:30:11.110
He's right.

01:30:11.970 --> 01:30:13.260
Lieutenant.

01:30:13.900 --> 01:30:14.940
Let's go.

01:30:17.110 --> 01:30:18.740
Can you get up, Ijuin?

01:30:20.240 --> 01:30:21.160
Thank you.

01:30:23.580 --> 01:30:24.410
Are you alright?

01:30:25.620 --> 01:30:26.870
What an idiot he is!

01:30:27.330 --> 01:30:29.960
He made his way through this fire to Hanamura ...

01:30:31.160 --> 01:30:32.420
The power of love ..

01:30:32.920 --> 01:30:34.760
against the power of the flame?

01:30:36.550 --> 01:30:37.840
The one you love so much ..

01:30:38.300 --> 01:30:40.510
If I take her from you now,

01:30:40.840 --> 01:30:44.210
would her whole world immediately become mine?

01:30:44.770 --> 01:30:46.880
No, that's not it.

01:30:47.140 --> 01:30:52.440
At this moment, the whole world would be shattered to pieces before my eyes.

01:30:55.110 --> 01:30:57.360
These houses are almost burnt down, about to collapse.

01:30:57.650 --> 01:30:58.400
We should hurry.

01:30:59.490 --> 01:31:00.320
Let's go.

01:31:00.860 --> 01:31:02.370
Three of us will survive.

01:31:19.220 --> 01:31:21.930
Is this the Tokyo we know?

01:31:22.260 --> 01:31:24.100
Who would have thought?

01:31:24.100 --> 01:31:27.520
And what should we do from now on?

01:31:27.770 --> 01:31:28.890
Benio-san ..

01:31:29.230 --> 01:31:31.900
It’s already morning, but you haven’t return yet.

01:31:31.900 --> 01:31:33.150
What if ..

01:31:33.940 --> 01:31:35.150
Benio!

01:31:35.150 --> 01:31:36.860
Ojisan!

01:31:36.860 --> 01:31:38.690
Don't be silly, Ranmaru!

01:31:39.110 --> 01:31:42.360
My Boss will not simply die! She definitely survived!

01:31:55.290 --> 01:31:56.630
Benio-san!

01:31:57.630 --> 01:31:59.260
Benio-san!

01:31:59.260 --> 01:32:01.380
Benio! Shinobu-san!

01:32:02.300 --> 01:32:04.390
Boss!

01:32:04.390 --> 01:32:05.890
Benio-san!

01:32:06.000 --> 01:32:07.330
Ranmaru!

01:32:07.330 --> 01:32:08.470
Thank goodness!

01:32:08.470 --> 01:32:11.640
Thank God! You're all back alive!

01:32:11.640 --> 01:32:14.020
Benio-san, thank goodness!

01:32:17.520 --> 01:32:19.530
Lieutenant! Chief!

01:32:25.700 --> 01:32:28.540
How long are you going follow me? Go back!

01:32:29.200 --> 01:32:30.620
I need to talk to you.

01:32:30.960 --> 01:32:32.960
We don't have anything to talk about.

01:32:32.960 --> 01:32:34.120
At least for me.

01:32:34.330 --> 01:32:37.460
And if you still insist on our conversation,

01:32:38.710 --> 01:32:40.510
Accept this!

01:32:55.600 --> 01:32:57.860
Now we're even.

01:33:01.320 --> 01:33:03.350
What are we even doing now?

01:33:03.650 --> 01:33:05.570
During this difficult time..

01:33:08.910 --> 01:33:10.790
If you don't make her happy ..

01:33:11.160 --> 01:33:12.120
I will kill you.

01:33:19.540 --> 01:33:20.550
Chief!

01:33:21.710 --> 01:33:22.670
Don't come here!

01:33:25.700 --> 01:33:28.760
Don't ever let Ijuin go again!

01:33:30.840 --> 01:33:32.270
Chief.

01:33:38.360 --> 01:33:39.270
Chief!

01:33:39.270 --> 01:33:40.320
Chief!

01:33:40.440 --> 01:33:41.730
So you're all alright.

01:33:41.730 --> 01:33:44.070
Tosei-san. Tosei.

01:33:44.070 --> 01:33:45.450
Mother?

01:33:45.450 --> 01:33:50.830
Tosei, your Mother was looking for you all night, but to no avail.

01:33:51.330 --> 01:33:56.710
Tosei-san, if anything happened to you, I won't survive it!

01:33:57.250 --> 01:33:58.670
Mother?

01:33:59.460 --> 01:34:03.240
It seems that I see my mother crying for the first time.

01:34:04.170 --> 01:34:07.880
It turns out that I didn't lose everything!

01:34:09.720 --> 01:34:11.810
Chief, look.

01:34:12.220 --> 01:34:13.180
Look at those people!

01:34:13.180 --> 01:34:15.180
Already started to sort out the rubble!

01:34:15.230 --> 01:34:16.100
Over there too.

01:34:16.100 --> 01:34:19.220
Yes, the strength of the spirit cannot be taken away from the people!

01:34:20.650 --> 01:34:24.320
I would like to know what our publishing house has turned into in this chaos.

01:34:24.730 --> 01:34:26.360
Let's go see it.

01:34:27.150 --> 01:34:29.360
I'll resign from the bank.

01:34:29.360 --> 01:34:31.570
Let's publish best-sellers together again!

01:34:34.410 --> 01:34:35.750
Hooray!

01:34:35.750 --> 01:34:38.460
Long live "Jyodansha"!

01:34:38.460 --> 01:34:39.580
Let's go!

01:34:45.130 --> 01:34:46.510
Benio-san.

01:34:46.510 --> 01:34:48.250
Lieutenant Ijuin!

01:34:48.250 --> 01:34:51.250
Congratulations on your wedding!

01:34:51.420 --> 01:34:54.700
Lieutenant and Benio, congratulations on your wedding!

01:35:09.240 --> 01:35:13.660
Finally, our promise has been fulfilled.

01:35:13.990 --> 01:35:18.620
You've dreamed for so many years for these two to get married.

01:35:19.500 --> 01:35:21.710
Don't be angry with me, my dear.

01:35:21.710 --> 01:35:25.130
Now I have nothing to regret and can die peacefully.

01:35:25.130 --> 01:35:30.180
What are you saying? You and I survived the great earthquake!

01:35:30.630 --> 01:35:34.100
Now we can live together in good health!

01:35:34.100 --> 01:35:37.140
At least until we see our great-grandchildren!

01:35:37.140 --> 01:35:38.140
My dear!

01:35:48.610 --> 01:35:50.990
What? You're leaving already?

01:35:52.240 --> 01:35:55.910
Yes, you know, the longer I hang around here, there more wistful I'll feel.

01:35:56.370 --> 01:35:57.240
Wistful?

01:35:57.240 --> 01:36:00.120
Ah, no. Never mind.

01:36:00.790 --> 01:36:02.500
By the way, where's Benio-san?

01:36:05.960 --> 01:36:08.380
I don't feel so good.

01:36:08.920 --> 01:36:12.300
Looks like she drank too much at the wedding yesterday.

01:36:12.720 --> 01:36:15.640
A hangover on the first day of marriage?

01:36:17.680 --> 01:36:20.770
Be happy, Lieutenant, Benio-san!

01:36:21.480 --> 01:36:23.690
I won't ever forget you two.

01:36:23.690 --> 01:36:26.440
Yes. And we will not forget you.

01:36:26.820 --> 01:36:30.100
Take care of yourself! Come back to Japan soon.

01:36:30.100 --> 01:36:33.320
Yes.I’ll come and bring souvenirs from Manchuria!

01:36:33.610 --> 01:36:35.320
Liquor .. Vodka ..

01:36:35.320 --> 01:36:36.320
Liquor?

01:36:36.910 --> 01:36:39.950
I can't think about liquor right now.

01:36:40.830 --> 01:36:41.960
I get it.

01:36:41.960 --> 01:36:42.910
Farewell.

01:36:43.120 --> 01:36:44.000
Wait!

01:36:44.670 --> 01:36:45.670
Well ..

01:36:45.670 --> 01:36:47.420
Maybe a little ...

01:36:50.260 --> 01:36:51.510
Lieutenant!

01:36:51.510 --> 01:36:53.720
You don't have to laugh like that!

01:36:54.220 --> 01:36:57.470
Lieutenant is laughing like old times.

01:36:57.760 --> 01:36:59.260
Now I don't have to worry.

01:37:01.930 --> 01:37:04.440
I'm sorry, Mr. Shinobu! I need some help.

01:37:04.440 --> 01:37:05.810
I'm coming.

01:37:07.230 --> 01:37:09.400
Benio! Benio!

01:37:09.400 --> 01:37:11.610
Tamaki. What happened?

01:37:12.690 --> 01:37:14.490
Have you seen Onijima-san?

01:37:14.490 --> 01:37:17.700
Onijima-san went back to Manchuria just now.

01:37:17.700 --> 01:37:19.450
What? He went back?

01:37:19.450 --> 01:37:21.450
Without saying anything to me?

01:37:22.660 --> 01:37:23.790
Tamaki?

01:37:24.620 --> 01:37:25.790
I won't forgive him!

01:37:25.790 --> 01:37:29.170
He ran away to where I can’t even go on my own.

01:37:29.500 --> 01:37:31.500
Eh? What do you mean?

01:37:32.340 --> 01:37:34.300
Wait! Where are you going?

01:37:34.760 --> 01:37:36.250
To work, of course!

01:37:36.430 --> 01:37:39.100
I hope they transfer me to a branch in Manchuria!

01:37:39.100 --> 01:37:40.260
What?!

01:37:40.260 --> 01:37:43.630
Wait, could it be that you ... towards Onijima-san ?

01:37:44.480 --> 01:37:45.190
Yes.

01:37:45.560 --> 01:37:47.600
I love him!

01:37:47.980 --> 01:37:49.610
That's why I will go after him.

01:37:49.860 --> 01:37:52.570
I won't let him taunt me by calling me "Princess".

01:37:53.230 --> 01:37:56.140
But what about the wedding? You decided to get married!

01:37:56.140 --> 01:37:57.490
What are you going to do about it?

01:37:57.490 --> 01:38:01.120
Well, since I'm running away from home, the groom can only give up.

01:38:01.900 --> 01:38:04.700
Goodbye. I'll write to you from Manchuria!

01:38:05.410 --> 01:38:06.580
Tamaki.

01:38:06.580 --> 01:38:08.900
The Princess and the bandit?

01:38:08.900 --> 01:38:11.500
I give up. But they're well-matched.

01:38:13.960 --> 01:38:16.590
We shall not be chosen by our husbands.

01:38:17.130 --> 01:38:19.680
We are the ones to choose.

01:38:21.220 --> 01:38:24.220
Tamaki, everything turned out as you said.

01:38:26.850 --> 01:38:29.350
All that we thought and dreamed at that time ..

01:38:29.600 --> 01:38:31.190
is still alive even now.

01:38:33.320 --> 01:38:34.860
.. in our hearts.

01:38:37.740 --> 01:38:40.620
What are you thinking about, Benio-san?

01:38:41.120 --> 01:38:42.330
Lieutenant.

01:38:45.870 --> 01:38:49.580
Let's be together forever.

01:38:55.880 --> 01:38:59.510
No matter what happens in this world,

01:39:00.220 --> 01:39:02.600
while people is still living on this earth,

01:39:02.600 --> 01:39:04.850
as long as life itself exists,

01:39:05.430 --> 01:39:08.460
we will live and love each other!

01:39:12.860 --> 01:39:14.440
Benio-san! Lieutenant!

01:39:14.440 --> 01:39:16.420
What are you doing here?

01:39:16.820 --> 01:39:20.320
There will be a charity dinner in the garden! Come and help!

01:39:22.370 --> 01:39:23.120
Let's go.

01:39:24.990 --> 01:39:25.790
Yes!

01:39:30.940 --> 01:39:32.290
Keep on living.

01:39:32.840 --> 01:39:34.590
Today and tomorrow.

01:39:35.130 --> 01:39:37.590
Wherever you are,

01:39:37.590 --> 01:39:39.630
no matter what separates you,

01:39:39.920 --> 01:39:41.800
Love and be loved!

01:39:42.430 --> 01:39:43.760
Keep on living.

01:39:44.220 --> 01:39:46.510
Under Tokyo's sky, life goes on!

01:39:46.510 --> 01:39:49.590
Hayami Saori - Atarashi Ashita "New Tomorrow"

01:39:46.510 --> 01:39:49.590
* Don't miss 1:43:34 to 1:44:04 mark ;)

01:39:59.110 --> 01:40:05.490
Aah, when I look back,

01:40:05.490 --> 01:40:11.790
even the many nights I dissolved in tears

01:40:11.790 --> 01:40:22.790
grow blurry with the memories.

01:40:24.470 --> 01:40:36.980
Aah, even the completely changed town will eventually

01:40:36.980 --> 01:40:48.830
regain its breath and start to move again

01:40:48.830 --> 01:40:55.210
Mankind accepts their fate,

01:40:55.210 --> 01:41:03.380
and continue living individually.

01:41:06.970 --> 01:41:18.390
You healed my sorrow, my friend.

01:41:18.860 --> 01:41:25.570
Before you go far away,

01:41:25.570 --> 01:41:30.760
let me say thank you.

01:41:41.800 --> 01:41:54.430
Aah, people and the eras change,

01:41:54.430 --> 01:41:59.860
and one day everything will be the past.

01:41:59.860 --> 01:42:06.070
Only the sky will remain the same...

01:42:06.070 --> 01:42:13.370
Aah, no matter what,

01:42:13.370 --> 01:42:19.500
I've lived ..

01:42:19.500 --> 01:42:25.210
without abandoning the ray of hope,

01:42:25.210 --> 01:42:31.510
believing only in love.

01:42:31.510 --> 01:42:37.850
Not forgetting our connected hearts,

01:42:37.850 --> 01:42:49.450
until the day we can meet again, take care.

01:42:49.450 --> 01:42:55.000
As long as there is life,

01:42:55.000 --> 01:43:01.500
the path will continue on.

01:43:01.500 --> 01:43:14.760
so we can discover our dreams once more.

01:43:14.760 --> 01:43:21.310
What awaits on our way is

01:43:21.310 --> 01:43:26.780
a new tomorrow.

01:43:26.780 --> 01:43:33.490
I can hear it from somewhere:

01:43:33.490 --> 01:43:40.290
The singing voice of hope.

01:44:30.260 --> 01:44:32.720
The Taisho era has long passed.

01:44:35.070 --> 01:44:37.740
The era of romance.

01:44:35.660 --> 01:44:37.850
WHITE BIRCH

01:44:43.810 --> 01:44:45.560
The era of Miss Modern.

01:44:48.360 --> 01:44:50.320
In our hearts

01:44:53.860 --> 01:44:55.660
always.
